ing humans and estimating rates…\",\"remote\":\"Remote-friendly\",\"candidatesAvailable\":\"{count} humans available\",\"noCandidates\":\"We'll help you find the right human.\",\"typicalRate\":\"Typical rate\",\"perHour\":\"/hr\",\"estimatedTotal\":\"Estimated total\",\"disclaimer\":\"Estimates are non-binding and may change as details are confirmed.\",\"taskSaved\":\"Your task is saved. Create a free account to continue.\",\"signup\":\"Create free account\",\"login\":\"Log in\",\"edit\":\"Edit task\"},\"browse\":{\"filters\":\"filters\",\"searchByName\":\"search humans by name...\",\"clearFilters\":\"clear filters\",\"messageRenta\":\"Message Renta\",\"title\":\"browse humans\",\"subtitle\":\"find meatspace workers for your agent\",\"filterSkill\":\"skill\",\"filterLocation\":\"location\",\"filterMaxRate\":\"max $/hr\",\"skillPlaceholder\":\"package pickup...\",\"locationPlaceholder\":\"sf, nyc...\",\"noHumans\":\"no humans yet\",\"beFirst\":\"be the first to join\",\"becomeRentable\":\"become rentable\",\"rent\":\"rent\",\"noBio\":\"no bio\",\"remote\":\"remote\",\"newRating\":\"new\",\"rentTitle\":\"rent\",\"howAreYouHiring\":\"how are you hiring this human?\",\"forMyAgent\":\"for my AI agent\",\"forMyAgentDesc\":\"get a snippet to paste into your agent's chat\",\"imHuman\":\"I'm a human\",\"messageDirectly\":\"message {name} directly\",\"copySnippet\":\"copy this and paste it into your AI agent's chat:\",\"copied\":\"✓ copied\",\"copy\":\"📋 copy\",\"howToUse\":\"how to use this\",\"howToStep1\":\"Copy the snippet above\",\"howToStep2\":\"Paste it into your AI agent's chat (Claude, ChatGPT, etc.)\",\"howToStep3\":\"Your agent will set up the MCP server and contact this human\",\"howToStep4\":\"You'll need an\",\"apiKey\":\"API key\",\"apiKeyDash\":\"— get one from your account\",\"verifyRequired\":\"verification required\",\"verifyRequiredDesc\":\"you need to be verified to message and rent humans.\",\"verifyBenefit1\":\"message any human directly\",\"verifyBenef