 on the list\",\"pendingSeatsFull\":\"Every spot is taken right now. You're first in line if one opens up.\",\"pendingReview\":\"We couldn't confirm a spot instantly, so your request is with the team. You'll hear back in the job chat.\",\"acceptedBodyHandoffPending\":\"Your spot is confirmed. Your corner, shift and sign pickup details are on their way to the job chat.\",\"closedTitle\":\"This application is closed\",\"closedBody\":\"It was withdrawn or declined before a spot could be confirmed, so you're not booked on this campaign.\",\"unknownTitle\":\"We couldn't confirm your spot yet\",\"unknownBody\":\"Your application was submitted. Check My Jobs in a moment to see whether you're booked.\"},\"taste\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Taste API for agents\",\"title\":\"Human taste, on tap for your agent.\",\"subtitle\":\"Real, vetted creatives — designers, stylists, musicians, and photographers — your AI can poll, A/B test with, and hire through one API.\",\"terminalLabel\":\"Agent prompt\",\"terminalStatus\":\"Taste API ready\",\"terminalScreenReaderLabel\":\"Example Taste API prompts\",\"promptLandingPages\":\"Have 50 people tell me which landing page is more appealing\",\"promptOutfit\":\"Have a stylist tell me which outfit looks better\",\"promptLogoConcepts\":\"Have 3 designers pick the strongest logo concept\",\"promptTrackMix\":\"Get 20 musicians to rate my track's mix\",\"setupTasteApi\":\"Set up the Taste API\",\"browseTalent\":\"Browse the talent\",\"pricingLandingPagesTitle\":\"50 people vote on your landing pages\",\"pricingLandingPagesPrice\":\"$$2 each · $100\",\"pricingStylistTitle\":\"A stylist reviews your outfit\",\"pricingStylistPrice\":\"from $10\",\"pricingDesignersTitle\":\"3 designers rank your logo concepts\",\"pricingDesignersPrice\":\"from $30\",\"talentTitle\":\"Vetted for taste\",\"categoriesLabel\":\"Taste categories\",\"all\":\"All\",\"design\":\"Design\",\"visualArt\":\"Visual art\",\"music\":\"Music\",\"photoVideo\":\"Photo \u0026 video\",\"fashionStyle\":\"Fashion \u0026 style\",\"writingPerformance\":\"Writing \u0026 performance\",\"noHumans\":\"No humans found\",\"noHumansDescription\":\"Try another creative category.\",\"loadError\":\"Creative profiles could not be loaded. Try again shortly.\",\"loadMore\":\"Load more\",\"allLoaded\":\"You've seen everyone in this category.\",\"ctaTitle\":\"Have taste? Get featured.\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Add your creative skills and portfolio photos so people and AI agents can find your work.\",\"createProfile\":\"Create your profile\",\"updateProfile\":\"Update your profile\",\"verified\":\"Verified\"},\"tasteStore\":{\"poweredBy\":\"Powered by Rent A Human\",\"navApi\":\"API\",\"navRuns\":\"Your tests\",\"heroEyebrow\":\"Human judgment, on demand\",\"heroTitle\":\"Know which version wins.\",\"heroSubtitle\":\"Real people pick the strongest version and tell you why.\",\"heroCta\":\"Start a comparison\",\"heroProof\":\"Qualified design experts · clear winner · written feedback\",\"howTitle\":\"From options to a decision\",\"howAddTitle\":\"Add your options\",\"howAddDescription\":\"Compare two to six images, videos, or live links.\",\"howVoteTitle\":\"Set the panel\",\"howVoteDescription\":\"Choose how many people vote and what each vote pays.\",\"howResultTitle\":\"Get a clear answer\",\"howResultDescription\":\"Receive the winner, vote split, summary, and respondent quotes.\",\"signInTitle\":\"Start your first comparison\",\"signInDescription\":\"Sign in with Rent A Human to fund the panel and keep every result in one place.\",\"signInCta\":\"Sign in to create a test\",\"workspaceTitle\":\"Create a comparison\",\"workspaceDescription\":\"Ask one focused question. Each respondent picks one option and explains the decision.\",\"questionLabel\":\"What should people decide?\",\"questionPlaceholder\":\"Which landing page feels more trustworthy?\",\"optionLabel\":\"Option {label}\",\"optionNamePlaceholder\":\"Short name\",\"optionUrlPlaceholder\":\"Paste a link\",\"uploadFile\":\"Upload image or video\",\"dropPasteFile\":\"Drop an image here, paste an image, or click to choose an image or video.\",\"fileTypes\":\"JPG, PNG, WebP, GIF, MP4, MOV, or WebM\",\"removeOption\":\"Remove option\",\"addOption\":\"Add another option\",\"panelTitle\":\"Panel and price\",\"requirementsTitle\":\"Who should vote?\",\"requirementsDescription\":\"Choose the profile and response requirements every paid voter must meet.\",\"experienceLabel\":\"Relevant experience\",\"experienceDescription\":\"Voters must have profile experience in at least one selected field. Leave all unchecked for any creative background.\",\"countriesLabel\":\"Profile country\",\"countriesDescription\":\"Uses the country on the voter’s Rent A Human profile. This is not a citizenship or nationality check.\",\"countriesAnywhere\":\"Any country\",\"countriesSelected\":\"countries selected\",\"countriesSearch\":\"Search countries\",\"countriesEmpty\":\"No country found.\",\"countriesRemove\":\"Remove\",\"genderLabel\":\"Gender\",\"genderDescription\":\"Uses the voter’s self-declared profile gender. Leave all unchecked for no restriction.\",\"genderMen\":\"Men\",\"genderWomen\":\"Women\",\"genderOther\":\"Non-binary / other\",\"identityRequiredLabel\":\"Require ID verification\",\"identityRequiredDescription\":\"Only voters who passed Rent A Human’s government ID check can apply.\",\"videoRequiredLabel\":\"Require a recorded video response\",\"videoRequiredDescription\":\"Each voter must attach a video explaining their pick before submitting.\",\"portfolioRequiredLabel\":\"Require a portfolio upload\",\"portfolioRequiredDescription\":\"Each voter must upload an image or DOCX portfolio sample when applying.\",\"votersLabel\":\"Number of voters\",\"payLabel\":\"Pay per voter\",\"totalLabel\":\"Total with service fee\",\"walletBalance\":\"Wallet balance\",\"fundingShortfall\":\"Add {amount} to fund this panel.\",\"launch\":\"Launch comparison\",\"launching\":\"Launching comparison…\",\"validationQuestion\":\"Write a question with at least 5 characters.\",\"validationOptions\":\"Add 2–6 options, each with a unique name and file or link.\",\"validationBudget\":\"Use whole-dollar voter pay of at least $0.50.\",\"workspaceDescriptionQuick\":\"Ask one focused question. Each voter taps the image they prefer.\",\"dropPasteImage\":\"Drop an image here, paste an image, or click to choose an image.\",\"imageFileTypes\":\"JPG, PNG, WebP, or GIF\",\"voteStyleLabel\":\"How should people vote?\",\"voteStyleFeedbackTitle\":\"Leave feedback\",\"voteStyleFeedbackDescription\":\"Voters pick an option and explain why. From $0.50 per voter.\",\"voteStyleQuickTitle\":\"One-tap vote\",\"voteStyleQuickDescription\":\"Voters tap the image they prefer, with no write-up. From $0.10 per vote.\",\"voteStyleQuickUnavailable\":\"Needs exactly two images and no video or portfolio requirement.\",\"payPerVoteLabel\":\"Pay per vote\",\"validationQuickBallot\":\"One-tap votes compare exactly two images, with no video or portfolio requirement.\",\"validationQuickBudget\":\"Pay at least $0.10 per vote and $1.00 in total.\",\"uploading\":\"Uploading option {label}…\",\"createError\":\"The comparison could not be launched. Try again.\",\"created\":\"Your comparison is live.\",\"runsTitle\":\"Your comparisons\",\"runsDescription\":\"Track votes and open completed results.\",\"createAnother\":\"Create another comparison\",\"runsEmptyTitle\":\"No comparisons yet\",\"runsEmptyDescription\":\"Your first test will appear here as soon as it launches.\",\"loadError\":\"Your comparisons could not be loaded.\",\"statusFunding\":\"Needs funds\",\"statusCollecting\":\"Collecting votes\",\"statusReviewing\":\"Preparing results\",\"statusClosed\":\"Results ready\",\"statusExpired\":\"Expired\",\"statusFailed\":\"Could not complete\",\"statusCancelling\":\"Cancelling\",\"statusCancelled\":\"Cancelled\",\"votesProgress\":\"{current} of {target} votes accepted\",\"votesReceived\":\"Votes received\",\"peopleAlerted\":\"People alerted\",\"panelistsAccepted\":\"Panelists accepted\",\"refreshing\":\"Updating…\",\"noVotesYet\":\"No votes yet. This view updates as accepted votes come in.\",\"winner\":\"Winner\",\"resultSummary\":\"What people said\",\"quotes\":\"Respondent notes\",\"addFunds\":\"Add funds\",\"apiTitle\":\"Agents can launch the same test\",\"apiDescription\":\"Use create_taste_run through the Rent A Human MCP server or REST API. Human and agent-created tests share the same panel, wallet, and results.\",\"apiDocs\":\"Read the API guide\",\"apiKeys\":\"Manage API keys\",\"terms\":\"Terms\",\"privacy\":\"Privacy\"},\"liveCamera\":{\"switchCamera\":\"Switch camera\",\"openingCamera\":\"Opening camera…\",\"switchFailed\":\"Could not switch cameras. This device may have only one camera.\",\"accessBlocked\":\"Camera or microphone access was blocked. Allow access and try again.\",\"openCamera\":\"Open camera\",\"recordVideo\":\"Record video\",\"stopRecording\":\"Stop recording\",\"takePhoto\":\"Take photo\",\"photoMode\":\"Live photo\",\"videoMode\":\"Live video\",\"bountyPhotoRequired\":\"Live photo capture required\",\"bountyVideoRequired\":\"Live video capture required\",\"bountyPhotoAndVideoRequired\":\"A live photo and a live video are required\",\"bountyCaptureHelp\":\"The accepted worker must capture this proof directly with their device camera.\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"retake\":\"Retake\",\"recordingLive\":\"Recording live · stops automatically after {seconds} seconds\",\"recordingIndicator\":\"REC\",\"interrupted\":{\"title\":\"Recording stopped — tap Retake\",\"hint\":\"The camera was interrupted, so nothing was saved.\"},\"noCaptions\":\"No captions available\",\"errors\":{\"captureUnsupported\":\"This browser does not support direct camera capture.\",\"cameraStarting\":\"The camera is still starting. Try again in a moment.\",\"frameCaptureFailed\":\"This browser could not capture the camera frame.\",\"photoFailed\":\"The photo could not be created. Please try again.\",\"recordingUnsupported\":\"This browser does not support live video recording.\",\"recordingFailed\":\"The video recording failed. Please try again.\",\"emptyRecording\":\"The video was empty. Please record it again.\"},\"aria\":{\"capturePreview\":\"Live camera capture preview\",\"recordedPreview\":\"Recorded live video preview\",\"livePreview\":\"Live camera preview\"}},\"bounties\":{\"taskExtras\":{\"characters\":\"characters\",\"taskRequirementsTitle\":\"Task requirements (optional)\",\"taskRequirementsHelp\":\"List the rules workers must follow, one per line.\",\"taskRequirementsPlaceholder\":\"Ask each café before pinning a flyer.\\nPhotograph all three flyers.\",\"gettingStartedTitle\":\"Getting started (optional)\",\"gettingStartedHelp\":\"Instructions sent to accepted workers in the bounty chat.\",\"gettingStartedPlaceholder\":\"e.g. Pick up the flyers at the front desk before starting.\",\"messagesTitle\":\"Messages to applicants (optional)\",\"messagesHelp\":\"Send a message automatically when you accept or decline an applicant.\",\"personalizationLabel\":\"Personalize messages\",\"personalizationHelp\":\"Use {{name}} and {{bountyTitle}} to personalize messages. {{deadline}} is filled only on AI-managed bounties. {{reason}} is available for decline messages.\",\"welcomeLabel\":\"Welcome message\",\"welcomePlaceholder\":\"Optional message sent when you accept an applicant.\",\"declineLabel\":\"Decline message\",\"declinePlaceholder\":\"Optional message sent when you decline an applicant.\"},\"verificationChecksTitle\":\"Verification checks\",\"workTiming\":{\"clockHelp\":\"The start deadline begins when the worker confirms their spot, or at the scheduled start if it is later. Missing it reopens their spot.\",\"workTimingTitle\":\"Work timing (optional)\",\"afterAcceptanceTitle\":\"After acceptance (optional)\",\"applicationsCloseLabel\":\"Applications close (optional)\",\"applicationsCloseHelp\":\"Stop accepting applications on this date. Leave blank to keep applications open.\",\"noticeHelp\":\"Allow at least {hours} hours of notice for this location.\",\"scheduledStartHelp\":\"Leave blank to start immediately after confirming.\",\"confirmationLabel\":\"Require workers to confirm their spot\",\"confirmationHelp\":\"Workers have {hours} hours after acceptance to confirm, or their spot reopens.\",\"startLabel\":\"Start within\",\"completionLabel\":\"Submit work within\",\"responseLabel\":\"Time without a response\",\"responseHelp\":\"Flag workers who have not responded within this time after acceptance.\",\"releaseLabel\":\"Release unresponsive workers automatically\",\"releaseHelp\":\"If off, you are notified and decide whether to release their spot.\",\"noLimit\":\"No time limit\",\"custom\":\"Custom…\",\"customDurationLabel\":\"Custom duration (1 hour to 30 days)\"},\"checkInsDescription\":\"Workers send a live selfie in the chat at each check-in. You can review the photos, timestamps, and any missed check-ins.\",\"locationScope\":{\"anywhere\":\"Anywhere\",\"city\":\"Specific city\",\"country\":\"Entire country\",\"anywhereDescription\":\"Workers can apply from any location.\"},\"createSteps\":{\"applicationDetails\":\"Application requirements (optional)\",\"taskDetails\":\"More task details (optional)\",\"timing\":\"Timing and worker confirmations (optional)\",\"navigationLabel\":\"Create bounty\",\"progress\":\"Step {current} of {total}\",\"task\":\"Task\",\"evidence\":\"Evidence\",\"applicants\":\"Applicants\",\"budget\":\"Budget\",\"review\":\"Review\",\"taskTitle\":\"What do you need done?\",\"taskDescription\":\"Describe the task and where the work will happen.\",\"evidenceTitle\":\"What counts as complete?\",\"evidenceDescription\":\"Choose how workers submit their work and what proof you need.\",\"applicantsTitle\":\"Who can apply?\",\"applicantsDescription\":\"Choose how you review applicants. Add questions or checks only if you need them.\",\"budgetTitle\":\"Set the pay and bonuses\",\"budgetDescription\":\"Choose your budget, number of workers, and any extra pay.\",\"reviewTitle\":\"Review your bounty\",\"reviewDescription\":\"Check the details below. You will review funding before the bounty is posted.\",\"editReviewDescription\":\"Check your changes below before saving.\",\"reviewFields\":{\"taskRequirements\":\"Task requirements\",\"howWorkersJoin\":\"How workers join\",\"applicantReview\":\"Applicant review\",\"questions\":\"Questions applicants answer\",\"acknowledgments\":\"Statements applicants confirm\",\"attachments\":\"Files applicants upload\",\"videoPrompt\":\"Video prompt for applicants\",\"requiredLinks\":\"Required links\",\"completionCriteria\":\"Completion criteria\",\"requiredEvidence\":\"Evidence to submit\",\"evidenceInstructions\":\"Evidence instructions\",\"submissionQuestions\":\"Questions workers answer when submitting\",\"workReview\":\"Work review\",\"required\":\"Required\",\"optional\":\"Optional\"},\"continue\":\"Continue\",\"editStep\":\"Edit {step}\",\"remote\":\"Remote work allowed\",\"textEvidence\":\"Text or data\",\"photoEvidence\":\"Photos\",\"videoEvidence\":\"Video\",\"linkEvidence\":\"Links\",\"directUploads\":\"Workers submit files directly.\",\"standardApplications\":\"Workers apply before starting.\",\"aiScreening\":\"AI screening is on.\",\"manualScreening\":\"You review applicants.\",\"basePay\":\"Base pay per worker\",\"perHour\":\"per hour\",\"duration\":\"Estimated duration\",\"seats\":\"Workers\"},\"returnUnusedFunds\":{\"action\":\"Release unused funds to wallet\",\"title\":\"Release unused funds to wallet\",\"description\":\"Move available funds from this finished bounty back to your wallet.\",\"loading\":\"Checking available funds…\",\"available\":\"Available to return\",\"workers\":\"Worker payments and fees\",\"reservedFunds\":\"Additional funds reserved\",\"workerExplanation\":\"Workers awaiting payment: {count}. Their funds stay protected.\",\"reserveExplanation\":\"Held until all accepted work is settled.\",\"capacity\":\"Funded spots after this return: {count}.\",\"noFunds\":\"No unused funds are available to return right now.\",\"reconciliation\":\"Worker or funding records need reconciliation. Contact support to review missing escrows or payment records. No funds have moved.\",\"changed\":\"The available funds changed. Refresh and review the amount before confirming again.\",\"failed\":\"We could not complete this request. Please try again.\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"refresh\":\"Refresh amount\",\"confirm\":\"Return {amount}\",\"submitting\":\"Returning funds…\",\"unconfirmed\":\"We could not confirm whether this return completed. Retry to check; the same return is never made twice.\",\"retry\":\"Retry returning {amount}\",\"refunded\":\"{amount} returned to your wallet.\"},\"managementMode\":{\"title\":\"MANAGEMENT\",\"manualLabel\":\"You review applicants\",\"aiLabel\":\"AI managed\",\"manualBody\":\"Turn on AI screening for applicants and AI review for submitted work.\",\"aiBody\":\"AI screening accepts qualified applicants and AI review checks their work. You keep the final say: accept or reject anyone from the applicants list.\",\"screeningOn\":\"AI screening accepts qualified applicants. Applications it is unsure about wait for you.\",\"reviewOn\":\"AI review checks submitted work before payment.\",\"switchesNote\":\"You keep the final say and can turn either off at any time.\",\"aiManualNote\":\"Want to hire by hand only? Stop the AI run when no one is accepted yet. That cancels this bounty and returns unused money to your wallet, so you can post it again as a manual bounty.\",\"action\":\"Enable AI\",\"submitting\":\"Turning on…\",\"failed\":\"We could not turn on AI. Nothing changed. Try again.\"},\"fundingBreakdown\":{\"title\":\"FUNDING\",\"seats\":\"{filled} of {total} seats filled\",\"headline\":{\"reserved_while_recruiting\":\"Held for empty seats\",\"automatic_on_settle\":\"Coming back to your wallet\",\"owner_action\":\"Ready to return to your wallet\",\"returned\":\"Returned to your wallet\",\"none\":\"Every funded seat was used\"},\"funded\":\"Funded\",\"filled\":\"Spent on filled seats ({count})\",\"returned\":\"Returned to your wallet\",\"unused\":\"Unused\",\"fees\":\"Service fees (included above)\",\"platformCost\":\"Printing and other platform costs (not refundable)\",\"feesRefunded\":\"Each empty seat's service fee comes back with it.\",\"feesKept\":\"Service fees on empty seats are not refunded.\",\"howTitle\":\"How unused money comes back\",\"how\":{\"reserved_while_recruiting\":\"Money for empty seats stays reserved while this bounty can still hire, so you can accept applicants. Want it back now? Lower the seat count in Edit bounty and the difference returns to your wallet right away.\",\"automatic_on_settle\":\"This bounty has stopped hiring. Once every accepted worker is paid, money for the empty seats returns to your wallet automatically. You don't need to do anything.\",\"owner_action\":\"This bounty isn't hiring, so its empty seats won't fill. Release unused funds to wallet moves the money to your wallet now. Workers still awaiting payment keep their funds.\",\"returned\":\"The unused money is in your wallet. Use it on your next bounty, or refund card top-ups to the card you paid with.\",\"none\":\"Nothing is left over from this bounty.\"},\"viewWallet\":\"View wallet balance\",\"learnMore\":\"How refunds work\",\"releaseSeats\":{\"action\":\"Release {amount} unused to wallet\",\"title\":\"Release {amount} to your wallet?\",\"body\":\"This lowers the bounty from {funded} seats to the {filled} already filled and puts {amount} back in your wallet now, service fees included. Hired workers keep their seats. To hire more later, add seats in Edit bounty.\",\"confirm\":\"Release {amount}\",\"submitting\":\"Releasing…\",\"cancel\":\"Keep seats open\",\"failed\":\"The release didn't go through. Refresh to see your latest balance, then try again.\"}},\"depositCallout\":{\"title\":\"Deposit required\",\"titleWalletCovers\":\"Ready to fund from your wallet\",\"body\":\"Your bounty is saved but not visible to applicants yet. Funding it reserves the total below in escrow until the work is approved.\",\"totalLabel\":\"Total to fund\",\"walletLabel\":\"Wallet balance (USD)\",\"checkoutLabel\":\"Charged at checkout\",\"loadingWallet\":\"Checking your wallet…\",\"walletUnknown\":\"We could not load your wallet balance. The deposit page shows the exact amount before anything is charged.\",\"quoteUnavailable\":\"Exact total shown on the deposit page\",\"fundFromWallet\":\"Fund {amount} from wallet\",\"completeDeposit\":\"Complete {amount} deposit\",\"continueToDeposit\":\"Continue to deposit\",\"funding\":\"Funding from wallet…\",\"openingCheckout\":\"Opening checkout…\",\"walletFirstHint\":\"Your wallet balance is applied first; only the remainder is charged at checkout.\",\"noCheckoutHint\":\"No checkout needed. The amount moves from your wallet into escrow.\",\"unsupportedCurrency\":\"This bounty is priced in {currency}. Deposits and wallet funding are available for USD bounties only, so it cannot be funded as priced. Edit the bounty to USD pricing to fund it.\",\"editBountyAction\":\"Edit bounty pricing\",\"walletExcessLabel\":\"Added to your wallet\",\"minimumTopUpHint\":\"Card top-ups are at least {minimum}. The {excess} above your remainder is added to your wallet balance; it is not an extra charge for this bounty.\",\"fundingUnavailable\":\"Funding is not available for this account yet.\",\"setupAction\":\"Complete account setup\",\"topUpUnavailableHint\":\"Add funds to your wallet to cover the remainder before funding this bounty.\",\"error\":\"We could not start the deposit. Please try again.\"},\"participantExclusion\":{\"title\":\"Exclude previous workers\",\"description\":\"Optional. Select earlier bounties to stop workers you accepted there from applying to this one. Leave all bounties unchecked to allow returning workers.\",\"emptyState\":\"No eligible earlier bounties found.\",\"selectedCount\":\"Bounties selected: {count}\"},\"applicantVetting\":{\"manageWork\":\"I'll manage work and payments\",\"manageWorkDescription\":\"You chat with workers, review completed work, and release payment.\",\"title\":\"AI screening\",\"enabledDescription\":\"Our AI reviews each application, accepts qualified applicants and turns down clear mismatches. Keep this off if you want to review and approve applicants yourself.\",\"disabledDescription\":\"You review and accept applicants yourself.\",\"gradingTitle\":\"AI review\",\"gradingDescriptionLead\":\"Our AI reviews each submission against what you asked for. With this on, it may approve the work and \",\"gradingDescriptionEmphasis\":\"pay the worker on your behalf\",\"gradingDescriptionTail\":\".\",\"gradingDisabledDescription\":\"You review and approve submissions yourself.\",\"toggleError\":\"AI screening could not be updated. Try again.\",\"gradingToggleError\":\"AI review could not be updated. Try again.\",\"unavailableTurnOffHint\":\"AI isn't available for this submission type. Turn it off to save.\",\"sectionTitle\":\"AI\"},\"managedWorkWindow\":{\"label\":\"Work window\",\"description\":\"How long each worker has to deliver after they are assigned before the spot goes to someone else. Leave the default unless the task takes longer.\",\"defaultOption\":\"Default (6 hours)\",\"savedAsHours\":\"Saved as {hours} hours.\"},\"confirmAttendance\":{\"title\":\"Confirm your spot\",\"description\":\"Your seat is held until you confirm. Replying in this chat confirms it too.\",\"timeLeft\":\"{time} left\",\"confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"confirming\":\"Confirming…\",\"confirmed\":\"Spot confirmed\",\"expired\":\"This spot was released because it was not confirmed in time.\",\"failed\":\"Could not confirm. Please try again.\",\"qa\":{\"title\":\"Review requirements, then begin\",\"description\":\"Review the exact grading requirements above. Video tasks require spoken microphone narration throughout; captions or written text are not substitutes. Your 6-hour timer starts when you accept.\",\"confirm\":\"Accept \u0026 begin\",\"confirming\":\"Starting…\",\"confirmed\":\"Assignment started\"},\"taste\":{\"title\":\"Confirm and start your taste vote\",\"description\":\"Your 6-hour timer starts when you confirm. Missing the deadline removes you from the job, reassigns the spot, and affects your worker rating.\",\"confirm\":\"Confirm \u0026 begin\",\"confirming\":\"Starting…\",\"confirmed\":\"Taste vote started\"}},\"referral\":{\"shareAndEarn\":\"Share \u0026 earn {amount}\",\"entryCaption\":\"Earn {amount} for each person you refer who gets hired and paid.\",\"cardTitle\":\"REFERRAL BONUS\",\"cardPerReferral\":\"per successful referral\",\"cardSummary\":\"Share your link. When someone applies through it, gets hired and their work is paid out, you earn the bonus automatically.\",\"cardClosed\":\"This bounty is no longer taking applications, so the referral bonus is no longer available.\",\"cardDeactivated\":\"This bounty is hidden for inactivity, so the referral bonus is not currently available.\",\"getLink\":\"Get your link\",\"dialogTitle\":\"Share \u0026 earn {amount}\",\"dialogDescription\":\"Each person you refer who gets hired for this bounty and paid earns you {amount}.\",\"yourLink\":\"Your link\",\"linkLoading\":\"Creating your link…\",\"linkError\":\"We couldn’t create your link. Please try again.\",\"retry\":\"Try again\",\"copyLink\":\"Copy link\",\"copied\":\"Copied\",\"shareVia\":\"Share via\",\"shareNative\":\"Share…\",\"shareWhatsApp\":\"WhatsApp\",\"shareSms\":\"SMS\",\"shareEmail\":\"Email\",\"shareX\":\"X\",\"shareMessage\":\"Rent A Human bounty: “{title}”. If it’s a fit, apply through my link:\",\"signInTitle\":\"Sign in to get your link\",\"signInDescription\":\"Your link carries your referral code, so we know who to pay when your referral gets hired.\",\"signIn\":\"Sign in\",\"howItWorksTitle\":\"How you earn {amount}\",\"step1\":\"Someone opens your link and applies to this bounty.\",\"step2\":\"They get hired and their work is paid out.\",\"step3\":\"{amount} is added to your Rent A Human balance, or sent to your connected payout account, automatically.\",\"rules\":\"One bonus per new applicant. Referring yourself, the poster, or someone who already applied doesn’t count, and the bounty must still be open when they apply.\"},\"application\":{\"videoRequiredLabel\":\"(Required)\",\"videoInstructions\":\"Record a short video following the prompt above (up to 60 seconds). You can review and retake it before applying. Record here using your camera; existing video files cannot be selected.\",\"videoRequiredToApply\":\"Record your video to submit this application.\",\"checkingEligibility\":\"Checking eligibility…\",\"eligibilityCheckFailed\":\"We couldn’t check whether you can apply. Please try again.\",\"loginToApply\":\"Please log in to apply\",\"humanizationSampleTitle\":\"Applicant rewrite sample\",\"humanizationSampleWaived\":\"You are a verified human writer, so the rewrite sample and its screen recording are not required for this application.\",\"micCheckRecordingPlay\":\"Play mic check\",\"micCheckRecordingLoading\":\"Loading recording…\",\"micCheckRecordingTitle\":\"Mic check recording · attempt {attempt}\",\"micCheckRecordingError\":\"Could not load the mic check recording.\",\"micCheckRecordingMissing\":\"No mic check recording was kept for this application (score only).\",\"writingVerifiedBadge\":\"verified writer\",\"writingVerifiedBadgeTitle\":\"A previous no-AI writing sample was verified as hand-written\",\"humanizationSampleDescription\":\"Rewrite this AI-generated sample without AI. Upload the rewritten document and a continuous screen recording below. Pangram results are advisory and the requester makes the decision.\",\"humanizationSampleWordCount\":\"{count} words\",\"humanizationSampleGoal\":\"Goal:\",\"noReviewsYet\":\"No reviews yet\",\"trackRecordLabel\":\"Track record\",\"