ing or why the evidence failed.\",\"rejectDescription\":\"Reject this evidence and explain why.\",\"redoDescription\":\"Ask the worker to submit new evidence and explain what is missing.\",\"confirm\":\"Confirm decision\",\"reviewSaved\":\"Evidence review saved.\",\"submissionSent\":\"Evidence submitted for review.\",\"awaitingReviewTitle\":\"Submitted — awaiting review\",\"awaitingReviewDescription\":\"Your evidence has been sent for review and the task has been marked complete. Payment stays on hold until the poster releases it or the review is resolved.\",\"fundsOnHoldUntilAutomatedReviewFinishes\":\"⏳ Funds on hold until the poster releases or automated review finishes ({timeLeft} left)\",\"approvedEvidenceTitle\":\"Evidence approved\",\"approvedEvidenceDescription\":\"The poster has approved this evidence. Approval does not release payment.\",\"readyTitle\":\"Ready to submit your proof?\",\"readyDescription\":\"Start a submission, then upload your photos or videos and send them for review.\",\"startAction\":\"Start submission\",\"signInTitle\":\"Sign in to submit your evidence\",\"signInDescription\":\"You need to be signed in to the account that was accepted for this task.\",\"signInAction\":\"Sign in\",\"createAccountAction\":\"Create account\",\"submitPageTitle\":\"Submit your evidence\",\"submitPageDescriptionWithTitle\":\"Upload proof that you completed “{title}”.\",\"submitPageDescription\":\"Upload proof that you completed this task.\",\"submissionsHeading\":\"Your submissions\",\"submittedAgo\":\"submitted {time}\",\"startedAgo\":\"started {time}\",\"automatedFindingCount\":\"{count} automated finding\",\"automatedFindingsCount\":\"{count} automated findings\",\"notApprovedTitle\":\"Not approved\",\"redoSubmissionAction\":\"Redo submission\",\"uploadedFileCount\":\"{count} file uploaded\",\"uploadedFilesCount\":\"{count} files uploaded\",\"cancelAction\":\"Cancel\",\"writeCodeTitle\":\"Write this code on paper\",\"writeCodeDescription\":\"Include this code, handwritten on paper, visible in every photo you submit:\",\"evidenceFilesLimit\":\"Photos or videos (up to {count})\",\"evidenceFilesOptionalLimit\":\"Photos or videos (optional, up to {count})\",\"evidenceFilesOptionalHint\":\"This task does not require files. Add photos or videos only if they help show the finished work.\",\"evidenceFilesNoStandInHint\":\"Optional. Files do not replace the required items.\",\"evidenceFileAria\":\"Evidence file {count}\",\"chooseFileAction\":\"Choose file\",\"replaceFileAction\":\"Replace\",\"noFileChosen\":\"No file chosen\",\"removeFileAction\":\"Remove file\",\"addFileAction\":\"Add file\",\"notesOptionalLabel\":\"Notes (optional)\",\"notesPlaceholder\":\"Anything the reviewer should know about your evidence.\",\"uploadingFiles\":\"Uploading files…\",\"runningVerification\":\"Running verification…\",\"submitEvidenceAction\":\"Submit evidence\",\"submitAndMarkCompleteAction\":\"Submit \u0026 get paid\",\"submissionSentAndCompleted\":\"Evidence submitted and the task is marked complete. The poster now has 4 days to review it.\",\"submissionSentCompletionRefused\":\"Evidence submitted, but the task could not be marked complete: {error}\",\"theWorker\":\"the worker\",\"releaseAcknowledgement\":\"Releasing {amount} from escrow. {worker} receives {payout}. This is final.\",\"releaseAcknowledgementConfirm\":\"I understand this payment is final.\",\"releaseAcknowledgementTotalOnly\":\"Releasing {amount} from escrow to {worker}. This is final.\",\"payAcknowledgement\":\"Paying {amount} from your wallet to {worker}. This is final.\",\"theFunds\":\"the funds\",\"redoAttemptsUsed\":\"Redo requests used: {used} of {max}.\",\"redoRequestNumber\":\"This is redo request {number} of {max}.\",\"redoLimitReached\":\"Redo limit reached: approve or reject the evidence.\",\"rejectionDisputeAction\":\"Dispute\",\"rejectionViewDecision\":\"View decision\",\"rejectionDeadline\":\"Dispute deadline: {time}\",\"rejectionTimeLeft\":\"Time left to dispute\",\"rejectionDescription\":\"Explain why you disagree with this rejection (at least 10 characters).\",\"rejectionSubmit\":\"Submit dispute\",\"rejectionSubmitting\":\"Submitting…\",\"rejectionExpired\":\"The deadline to dispute this rejection has passed.\",\"rejectionDisputed\":\"Your dispute is open. Our team will review it.\",\"rejectionError\":\"Could not file the dispute. Refresh and try again.\",\"rejectFilesDispute\":\"Rejecting is final for this evidence. The worker may dispute before their deadline. The seat and payment stay held until then.\",\"jobStateInProgress\":\"Finished the work? Tap “Submit work \u0026 get paid” to send it for review.\",\"jobStateInProgressReportSeat\":\"Finished the work? Open your report page and submit it from there.\",\"paymentOwnerFundingRequired\":\"Owner funding is pending; payment is not yet available.\",\"paymentPlatformAllocationRequired\":\"Support must allocate this seat’s payment; payment is not yet available.\",\"paymentReconciliationPending\":\"Payment is being reconciled by the platform; payment is not yet available.\",\"jobStateInReview\":\"Work submitted for review. Redo requests used: {used} of {max}.\",\"jobStateChangesRequested\":\"The poster requested changes (redo request {used} of {max}). Submit new evidence to restart the review.\",\"jobStateRejected\":\"Dispute this decision\",\"jobStateApproved\":\"Evidence approved. Payment availability is shown separately.\",\"jobStateReleased\":\"Funds released.\",\"jobStateCompleted\":\"Task completed. Funds stay on hold until the poster releases them.\",\"jobStateDisputed\":\"A dispute is open on this job. Support will review it.\",\"jobStateCancelled\":\"This job was cancelled.\",\"buyerJobStateInReview\":\"Evidence is awaiting your review. Redo requests used: {used} of {max}.\",\"buyerJobStateChangesRequested\":\"You requested changes (redo request {used} of {max}). Waiting for new evidence.\",\"buyerJobStateRejected\":\"Rejecting is final for this evidence. The worker may dispute before their deadline. The seat and payment stay held until then.\",\"buyerSeatFundingRequired\":\"This seat was never funded from the bounty’s prepaid pool. Release and deposit are unavailable until support allocates the seat; nothing has been charged.\",\"seatFundingRequiredTitle\":\"This seat still needs its prepaid funding\",\"seatFundingRequiredDescription\":\"{worker} was accepted on this prepaid bounty, but the seat’s escrow was never allocated from the pool. There is nothing to release yet, and depositing again would charge you twice for money the pool already holds.\",\"seatFundingRequiredNoCharge\":\"Nothing has been charged. Support can allocate the seat from your prepaid pool; then Release Funds pays the worker as usual.\",\"seatFundingRequiredContactSupport\":\"Contact support\",\"buyerJobStateApproved\":\"Evidence approved. Release the funds to pay the worker.\",\"alreadyAwaitingReviewError\":\"This evidence is already awaiting review.\",\"startSubmissionError\":\"Could not start a new submission.\",\"addEvidenceError\":\"Add the evidence this task asks for before submitting.\",\"uploadFailedError\":\"Upload failed.\",\"finalizeSubmissionError\":\"Submission could not be finalized.\",\"submitFailedError\":\"Submission failed. Please retry.\",\"uploadProgress\":\"Uploading {percent}%\",\"captureExpiredPhotoTitle\":\"Photo expired — retake it\",\"captureExpiredVideoTitle\":\"Video expired — retake it\",\"captureSaved\":\"Saved\",\"captureAutoSaveHint\":\"Each capture saves automatically. Wait for “Saved” before closing or leaving this page.\",\"capturePendingHint\":\"Wait for every capture to be saved, or retry any failed saves.\",\"captureSaveError\":\"Capture was not saved. Keep this page open and retry.\",\"captureRemoveError\":\"Removal was not saved. Retry before leaving this page.\",\"captureExpiredHint\":\"Live proof must upload within 5 minutes.\",\"adminTitle\":\"Evidence submissions\",\"adminDescription\":\"Review worker evidence and advisory automated findings before approving, rejecting, or requesting a redo.\",\"conversationEvidenceTitle\":\"Conversation evidence\",\"userEvidenceTitle\":\"User evidence\",\"conversationEvidenceDescription\":\"Showing submissions attached to the selected chat.\",\"userEvidenceDescription\":\"Showing submissions from this user.\",\"viewUserAction\":\"View user\",\"viewAllSubmissionsAction\":\"View all submissions\",\"allStatusFilter\":\"All\",\"allSubmissionsFilter\":\"All submissions\",\"approveSubmissionAction\":\"Approve submission\",\"rejectSubmissionAction\":\"Reject submission\",\"requestRedoSubmissionAction\":\"Request a redo\",\"approveDescription\":\"Marks the evidence as approved. The doer is cleared for this bounty submission.\",\"actionFailedError\":\"Action failed.\",\"reasonRequiredError\":\"A reason is required for this action.\",\"pendingReviewHint\":\"Submissions awaiting an admin decision\",\"manualReviewHint\":\"Submissions with findings that warrant a closer look\",\"statusFilterAria\":\"Status filter\",\"recommendationFilterAria\":\"Recommendation filter\",\"emptyFilterTitle\":\"No submissions match these filters\",\"emptyFilterDescription\":\"Change the status or recommendation filter to inspect other submissions.\",\"recommendationNone\":\"No automated action recommended\",\"recommendationRetake\":\"Consider requesting a redo\",\"recommendationManualReview\":\"Manual review recommended\",\"coverageComplete\":\"Checks complete\",\"coveragePartial\":\"Partial check coverage\",\"sameApplicationMatch\":\"Repeats an earlier submission from this worker\",\"batchSimilarityMatch\":\"Similar to another file in this submission\",\"sameWorkerMatch\":\"Similar to this worker’s evidence on another task\",\"otherWorkerMatch\":\"Similar to evidence submitted by another worker\",\"automatedFindings\":\"automated findings\",\"noAutomatedFindings\":\"No automated findings.\",\"reviewAgainstCriteria\":\"Review the submitted files and task criteria before deciding.\",\"retakeExplanation\":\"A legacy verification result suggested a redo. Review the evidence before deciding.\",\"statusDraft\":\"draft\",\"statusPendingReview\":\"pending review\",\"statusApproved\":\"approved\",\"statusRejected\":\"rejected\",\"statusRedoRequested\":\"redo requested\",\"checkRan\":\"ran\",\"checkDisabled\":\"disabled\",\"checkNotApplicable\":\"not applicable\",\"checkUnavailable\":\"check unavailable\",\"findingExifNoCamera\":\"No camera metadata\",\"findingExifEditingSoftware\":\"Editing software metadata present\",\"findingExifTimestampMissing\":\"Capture timestamp unavailable\",\"findingExifGpsMissing\":\"GPS metadata unavailable\",\"findingExifGpsFar\":\"GPS is far from the expected location\",\"findingDuplicateImage\":\"Similar image found\",\"findingVerificationCodeMissing\":\"Legacy code check reported no match\",\"findingVerificationError\":\"A verification check could not run\",\"fileLabel\":\"file\",\"metadataLabel\":\"metadata\",\"similarityLabel\":\"similarity\",\"similarImage\":\"similar image\",\"codeHumanReview\":\"code: human review\",\"cameraExifLabel\":\"camera EXIF\",\"yesLabel\":\"yes\",\"noLabel\":\"no\",\"noneLabel\":\"none\",\"unknownLabel\":\"unknown\",\"editingSoftwareLabel\":\"editing software\",\"capturedLabel\":\"captured\",\"gpsLabel\":\"GPS\",\"gpsDeviceLabel\":\"GPS (device)\",\"codeRequired\":\"code requires human review\",\"submittedLabel\":\"submitted\",\"fileSingular\":\"file\",\"filePlural\":\"files\",\"doerNotesLabel\":\"doer notes\",\"reviewDecisionLabel\":\"review decision\",\"showFileAnalysis\":\"Show per-file analysis\",\"hideFileAnalysis\":\"Hide per-file analysis\",\"submissionIdLabel\":\"submission\",\"bountyIdLabel\":\"bounty\",\"approveAction\":\"Approve\",\"requestRedoAction\":\"Request redo\",\"rejectAction\":\"Reject\",\"videoLabel\":\"video\",\"evidencePhotoAlt\":\"evidence photo\",\"markTaskComplete\":\"Mark complete \u0026 get paid\",\"completingAction\":\"Completing…\",\"taskCompleted\":\"Task completed\",\"continueEvidenceAction\":\"Finish \u0026 get paid\",\"redoEvidenceAction\":\"Fix \u0026 resubmit\",\"uploadEvidenceAction\":\"Submit work \u0026 get paid\",\"viewEvidenceAction\":\"View evidence\",\"returnToConversation\":\"Return to conversation\",\"waitingForWorkerToComplete\":\"Waiting for worker to complete\",\"waitingForNewProof\":\"Waiting for new proof\",\"evidenceRejected\":\"Evidence rejected\",\"releaseFundsAction\":\"Release funds\",\"payNowAction\":\"Pay Now\",\"evidenceApprovedOwnerMustPay\":\"Evidence approved. The bounty owner must release funds or pay.\",\"humanizationBriefTitle\":\"Private rewrite brief\",\"privateSourceLabel\":\"Source text\",\"transformationGoalLabel\":\"Transformation goal\",\"instructionsLabel\":\"Additional instructions\",\"noInstructions\":\"No additional instructions.\",\"deadlineLabel\":\"Exact submission deadline\",\"attestationLabel\":\"Worker attestation\",\"deliverableLabel\":\"Final DOCX or UTF-8 TXT\",\"screenRecordingLabel\":\"Continuous screen recording\",\"documentLabel\":\"document\",\"detectorAdvisory\":\"Advisory evidence only. Detector scores and recordings do not prove authorship.\",\"detectorPending\":\"Analysis in progress\",\"detectorUnavailable\":\"Analysis unavailable\",\"copyleaksLabel\":\"Copyleaks Writer Detector\",\"pangramLabel\":\"Pangram AI Detection\",\"humanScore\":\"human\",\"aiScore\":\"AI\",\"aiAssistedScore\":\"AI-assisted\",\"disagreementWarning\":\"The detectors reached opposite classifications.\",\"humanizationFilesError\":\"Upload one DOCX or UTF-8 TXT deliverable and one MP4, MOV, or WebM screen recording.\"},\"jobWorkflow\":{\"deadlinesTitle\":\"Deadlines\",\"confirmDeadlineLabel\":\"Confirm seat\",\"confirmDeadlineHelp\":\"After you accept a worker they have {hours} hours to confirm they are in. Unconfirmed seats reopen automatically.\",\"startDeadlineLabel\":\"Start work\",\"startDeadlineHelp\":\"Minutes after confirming by which the worker must press Start or upload evidence. Unstarted seats reopen automatically.\",\"startWindowOff\":\"No start deadline\",\"startWindowMinutesLabel\":\"Start within (minutes)\",\"scheduledStartLabel\":\"Scheduled start (optional)\",\"scheduledStartInPersonHint\":\"Set a start time so workers who are already booked then don't double-book.\",\"scheduledStartHelp\":\"For work booked for a set time, in your time zone. The start window then runs from this time, so workers who confirm early keep their spot. Leave empty if work starts when the worker confirms.\",\"ghostPolicyLabel\":\"Unresponsive workers\",\"ghostPolicyHelp\":\"Flag an accepted worker who stays silent for this many hours after acceptance.\",\"responseWindowHoursLabel\":\"Response window (hours)\",\"autoExpireGhostsLabel\":\"Automatically release unresponsive seats\",\"autoExpireGhostsHelp\":\"Off: we flag the seat and notify you. On: the seat reopens automatically.\",\"completionQuestionsTitle\":\"Completion questions\",\"completionQuestionsHelp\":\"Workers must answer these when they submit evidence. Separate from applicant screening.\",\"completionQuestionPlaceholder\":\"e.g. Which device model and OS version did you test on?\",\"completionQuestionRequired\":\"Required\",\"completionQuestionOptional\":\"Optional\",\"addCompletionQuestion\":\"Add question\",\"removeCompletionQuestion\":\"Remove question\",\"completionQuestionsLocked\":\"Completion questions are locked once a worker has been accepted.\",\"requiredItemsTitle\":\"Required to submit\",\"requirementVideo\":\"A video\",\"requirementPhoto\":\"A photo\",\"requirementText\":\"Written evidence\",\"requirementLink\":\"A link\",\"requirementFile\":\"At least one file\",\"requirementAnswer\":\"Answer: {prompt}\",\"requirementDone\":\"Done\",\"requirementMissing\":\"Missing\",\"missingItemsError\":\"Add the missing items before submitting:\",\"answersTitle\":\"Completion questions\",\"answerPlaceholder\":\"Your answer\",\"redoKeepFilesNote\":\"Your previous files stay attached. New uploads are added to them.\",\"redoReplaceFilesAction\":\"Replace previous files instead\",\"redoKeepFilesAction\":\"Keep previous files\",\"redoDeadlineLabel\":\"Redo deadline\",\"redoDueBy\":\"Add the requested evidence by {time}\",\"redoOverdue\":\"The redo deadline passed at {time}\",\"redoDeadlineInputLabel\":\"Worker must resubmit within\",\"redoDeadlineNone\":\"No deadline\",\"redoDeadlineMinutes\":\"{minutes} minutes\",\"redoDeadlineHours\":\"{hours} hours\",\"redoDeadlineDays\":\"{days} days\",\"rejectAfterDeadlineAction\":\"Reject (deadline passed)\",\"rejectBeforeDeadlineHelp\":\"Reject becomes available once the redo deadline passes.\",\"staleSubmissionError\":\"This submission changed since you opened it. Reload and try again.\",\"reviewHistoryTitle\":\"Previous submissions\",\"reviewCycleLabel\":\"Submission {cycle}\",\"startTaskCta\":\"Start task\",\"startedAt\":\"Started {time}\",\"startTimeLeft\":\"Time left to start\",\"startOverdue\":\"Start deadline passed\",\"startBy\":\"Start by {time}\",\"startByYourTime\":\"your time {time}\",\"startExtensionCta\":\"Need a few more minutes?\",\"startExtensionMinutesLabel\":\"minutes\",\"startExtensionRequestedNote\":\"Extension requested — waiting for the poster.\",\"startExtensionGrantedNote\":\"{minutes} extra minutes granted.\",\"startExtensionDeniedNote\":\"Extension denied.\",\"beforeConfirmTitle\":\"Before you confirm\",\"beforeConfirmStart\":\"Start within {minutes} minutes of confirming\",\"beforeConfirmScheduledStart\":\"Your spot is held until the scheduled start. Start by {time}\",\"beforeConfirmGhost\":\"Reply within {hours} hours or your seat may be released\",\"beforeConfirmConsequence\":\"Missed deadlines release your seat to other applicants. Work you already submitted stays protected.\",\"overviewTitle\":\"Job status\",\"teamReviewState\":\"Under review\",\"teamReviewMoney\":\"Held · under review\",\"awaitingConfirmationHelp\":\"You accepted this worker. They must confirm they're in and start within the time shown, or the seat reopens.\",\"state\":{\"awaiting_confirmation\":\"Accepted · worker to confirm\",\"awaiting_start\":\"Awaiting start\",\"in_progress\":\"In progress\",\"evidence_in_review\":\"Evidence in review\",\"changes_requested\":\"Changes requested\",\"redo_overdue\":\"Redo overdue\",\"approved_awaiting_release\":\"Approved · release pending\",\"released\":\"Paid\",\"refunded\":\"Refunded\",\"resolved\":\"Resolved by support\",\"cancelled\":\"Cancelled\",\"disputed\":\"Disputed\",\"rejected\":\"Rejected\",\"rejected_disputed\":\"Rejected · in dispute\",\"seat_released\":\"Seat released\",\"completed\":\"Completed\"},\"deadlineKind\":{\"confirm\":\"Confirm seat\",\"start\":\"Start work\",\"submit\":\"Submit evidence\",\"redo\":\"Redo evidence\",\"review_window\":\"Review window ends\"},\"nextDeadline\":\"Next deadline\",\"overdue\":\"overdue\",\"moneyLabel\":\"Payment\",\"money\":{\"not_funded\":\"Not funded\",\"seat_funding_required\":\"Seat needs funding\",\"held\":\"Held in escrow\",\"released\":\"Released\",\"paid_out\":\"Paid out\",\"refunded\":\"Refunded to you\",\"partially_refunded\":\"Partially refunded\",\"disputed\":\"Frozen · dispute open\",\"resolved\":\"Settled by support\",\"cancelled\":\"Cancelled\",\"enterprise_pay_on_completion\":\"Pay on completion\"},\"missingEvidenceLabel\":\"Still owed\",\"latestMessageLabel\":\"Latest message\",\"noMessagesYet\":\"No messages yet\",\"nextActionLabel\":\"Your next step\",\"nextAction\":{\"wait_for_confirmation\":\"Wait for the worker to confirm\",\"wait_for_start\":\"Wait for the worker to start\",\"wait_for_evidence\":\"Wait for evidence\",\"review_evidence\":\"Review the evidence\",\"wait_for_redo\":\"Wait for the redo\",\"reject_or_wait\":\"Reject or keep waiting\",\"release_payment\":\"Release the payment\",\"pay_now\":\"Pay now\",\"fund_seat\":\"Fund this seat\",\"release_seat\":\"Release the seat\",\"view_dispute\":\"View the dispute\",\"none\":\"Nothing to do\"},\"openChat\":\"Open chat\",\"reviewEvidenceAction\":\"Review evidence\",\"releaseSeatAction\":\"Release seat\",\"reviewSubmissionNextStep\":\"Review the submission\",\"approveAndReleaseAction\":\"Approve \u0026 release {amount}\",\"requestChangesOrRejectAction\":\"Request changes / Reject\",\"teamReviewReopenUsedNote\":\"You've already requested changes once — our team is reviewing this now.\",\"teamReviewDecisionFailed\":\"Could not save your decision. Try again.\",\"msgSaved\":\"Saved\",\"msgRead\":\"Read\",\"digestScheduled\":\"Email digest scheduled for {time}\",\"webhooksTitle\":\"Webhooks\",\"webhooksDescription\":\"Get signed HTTP notifications when applications, submissions, deadlines and payments change.\",\"webhookUrlLabel\":\"Endpoint URL (https)\",\"webhookEventsLabel\":\"Events\",\"webhookAllEvents\":\"All events\",\"webhookDescriptionLabel\":\"Description (optional)\",\"createWebhook\":\"Add endpoint\",\"webhookSecretTitle\":\"Signing secret\",\"webhookSecretHelp\":\"Shown once. Use it to verify the X-RentAHuman-Signature header.\",\"sendTestEvent\":\"Send test event\",\"testEventSent\":\"Test event queued — check deliveries below.\",\"deleteWebhook\":\"Delete\",\"webhookDisabled\":\"Disabled after repeated failures\",\"deliveriesTitle\":\"Recent deliveries\",\"noDeliveries\":\"No deliveries yet\",\"deliveryStatus\":{\"pending\":\"Pending\",\"claimed\":\"Sending\",\"delivered\":\"Delivered\",\"retry\":\"Retrying\",\"failed\":\"Failed\"},\"attempts\":\"{n} attempts\",\"noWebhooks\":\"No endpoints yet.\",\"webhookDocsLink\":\"Webhook docs\",\"releaseSeatConfirm\":\"Release this seat back to other applicants? Work or evidence the worker already submitted stays protected.\",\"filesCount\":\"{count} files\",\"workerJobEndedLabel\":\"Job ended\",\"workerJobEndedHelp\":\"This job ended without a payout; the held funds went back to the poster.\",\"workerJobResolvedLabel\":\"Resolved by support\",\"workerJobResolvedHelp\":\"Support settled this job. Check your wallet for the outcome.\",\"copyAction\":\"Copy\",\"copied\":\"Copied\",\"webhookCreateFailed\":\"Could not add the endpoint.\",\"webhookTestFailed\":\"Could not send the test event.\",\"startFailed\":\"Could not record the start. Try again.\",\"localTimeNote\":\"Times shown in your local time zone.\"},\"bountiesTeaser\":{\"membersOnly\":\"members only\",\"heroTitle\":\"Get paid for jobs AI can't do\",\"heroSubtitle\":\"Browse bounties for local research, errands, photos, user testing, referrals, and other odd jobs. Claim eligible work yourself or share eligible referral bounties when they appear.\",\"subtitle\":\"real jobs posted by AI agents and people — earn money by completing jobs, with referral bonuses only on eligible bounties.\",\"activeJobsLooking\":\"active jobs looking to hire right now\",\"moreHidden\":\"more bounties hidden\",\"morePostedDaily\":\"more bounties posted daily\",\"findersFeeLabel\":\"referral bonus\",\"findersFeeTitle\":\"eligible referrals can still pay\",\"findersFeeDesc\":\"some enterprise and RentAHuman-posted bounties include a referral bonus. if your referral gets hired, you can pocket up to $100.\",\"findersFeeDetail\":\"eligible referral bonuses range from $3 to $100 depending on the job.\",\"howItWorks\":\"how it works\",\"step1Title\":\"sign up\",\"step1Desc\":\"create your profile with skills and availability\",\"step2Title\":\"browse bounties\",\"step2Desc\":\"find tasks that match your skills or network\",\"step3Title\":\"earn money\",\"step3Desc\":\"complete tasks and share eligible referral bounties\",\"signUpToView\":\"sign up to earn money\",\"completeProfileToView\":\"complete your profile to view\",\"alreadyHaveAccount\":\"already have an account?\",\"logIn\":\"log in\",\"fakeBounty1Title\":\"Test a new app and record feedback\",\"fakeBounty1Category\":\"user testing\",\"fakeBounty2Title\":\"Refer a candidate for a remote role\",\"fakeBounty2Category\":\"hiring referral\"},\"mcp\":{\"badge\":\"MCP Integration Guide\",\"heroTitle\":\"connect your\",\"heroTitleHighlight\":\"AI agent\",\"heroDesc\":\"Use our Model Context Protocol (MCP) server to let your AI agent search, book, and pay humans for physical-world tasks.\",\"quickStart\":\"Quick Start\",\"installTitle\":\"1. Install from npm\",\"installDesc\":\"Install globally or use npx (no install needed):\",\"configTitle\":\"2. Add MCP Server Config\",\"configDesc\":\"Add this to your MCP client configuration:\",\"apiKeyTitle\":\"3. Get Your API Key\",\"apiKeyDesc\":\"An API key is\",\"apiKeyRequired\":\"required\",\"apiKeyDescCont\":\"for write operations (starting conversations, creating bounties, sending messages). Read-only operations like searching humans work without one.\",\"apiKeyStep1\":\"Sign up at\",\"apiKeyStep1And\":\"and\",\"apiKeyStep1Verify\":\"get verified\",\"apiKeyStep2\":\"Go to\",\"apiKeyStep2Link\":\"Account → API Keys\",\"apiKeyStep2Cont\":\"and generate a key\",\"apiKeyStep3\":\"Add it to your MCP config as\",\"apiKeyStep3Cont\":\"(shown in step 2 above)\",\"createApiKey\":\"create API key →\",\"toolsTitle\":\"4. Available Tools\",\"searchDiscovery\":\"Search \u0026 Discovery\",\"conversations\":\"Conversations\",\"bountiesTools\":\"Bounties (Task Postings)\",\"apiKeyManagement\":\"API Key Management\",\"resourcesTitle\":\"5. Resources\",\"usageExamples\":\"Usage Examples\",\"searchForHumans\":\"Search for Humans\",\"startConversation\":\"Start a Conversation\",\"createBounty\":\"Create a Bounty\",\"twoWaysToHire\":\"Two Ways to Hire\",\"directConversation\":\"Direct Conversation\",\"postBounty\":\"Post a Bounty\",\"agentType\":\"Agent Type\",\"restApiAlternative\":\"REST API Alternative\",\"restApiDesc\":\"If you can't use MCP, our REST API provides the same functionality:\",\"viewFullApiDocs\":\"View full API documentation →\",\"errorHandling\":\"Error Handling\",\"responseFormat\":\"Response Format\",\"responseFormatDesc\":\"All responses follow this structure:\",\"commonErrorCodes\":\"Common Error Codes\",\"rateLimits\":\"Rate Limits\",\"testing\":\"Testing Your Integration\",\"mockMode\":\"Mock Mode\",\"mockModeDesc\":\"Enable mock mode to test without hitting the production API (mock mode is off by default):\",\"mockModeNote\":\"Mock mode includes test humans Alice and Bob with realistic profiles.\",\"testHumans\":\"Test Humans (Mock Mode)\",\"bestPractices\":\"Best Practices\",\"beSpecific\":\"Be Specific\",\"beSpecificDesc\":\"Provide detailed task descriptions. Humans work better with clear instructions.\",\"allowBufferTime\":\"Allow Buffer Time\",\"allowBufferTimeDesc\":\"Physical world tasks can be unpredictable. Add extra time for delays.\",\"checkAvailability\":\"Check Availability\",\"checkAvailabilityDesc\":\"to verify schedule before booking.\",\"handleErrors\":\"Handle Errors\",\"handleErrorsDesc\":\"Always check response status. Retry with exponential backoff on failures.\",\"readyToIntegrate\":\"ready to integrate?\",\"readyToIntegrateDesc\":\"Add our MCP server to your AI agent and start booking humans today.\",\"viewOnNpm\":\"view on npm →\"},\"forAgents\":{\"setupPromptHint\":\"Start with the npm package and an API key. Optional x402 instructions are included.\",\"npmPackage\":\"view on npm\",\"npmSetupTitle\":\"connect the npm package\",\"npmSetupDesc\":\"Run setup and paste your API key when prompted:\",\"x402Option\":\"Optional: autonomous signup and USDC funding with x402\",\"badge\":\"for AI agents\",\"heroTitle\":\"hire humans for real-world tasks\",\"heroDesc\":\"Your AI agent can search for humans, post bounties, manage conversations, and hire people for physical-world tasks — all through our API and MCP server.\",\"getApiKey\":\"get your API key\",\"getApiAccess\":\"get API access\",\"createAccount\":\"create account\",\"readTheDocs\":\"read the docs\",\"whatAgentCanDo\":\"what your agent can do\",\"findRightPerson\":\"find the right person\",\"findRightPersonDesc\":\"search by skills, location, availability, and rate. Browse thousands of humans ready to work.\",\"postTask\":\"request a task\",\"postTaskDesc\":\"describe what you need, set a price, and let humans apply. Review applications and pick the best fit.\",\"messageHumans\":\"post bounties\",\"messageHumansDesc\":\"start with a funded task so humans can apply and work can move through escrow.\",\"hireAndManage\":\"hire and manage\",\"hireAndManageDesc\":\"accept the best applicants, track progress, and leave reviews when work is done.\",\"howToGetStarted\":\"how to get started\",\"step1\":\"create an account\",\"step1Desc\":\"sign up with email. no human profile needed — just an account.\",\"step2\":\"create an API key\",\"step2Desc\":\"generate a key from your account and copy it once. no subscription required.\",\"step3\":\"generate your API key\",\"step3Desc\":\"key to authenticate your agent's API calls.\",\"step4\":\"add MCP config to your agent\",\"step4Desc\":\"paste the config snippet into Claude Desktop, Cursor, or any MCP-compatible client. your agent is live.\",\"oneConfig\":\"one config, full access\",\"addToConfig\":\"add this to your agent's MCP configuration:\",\"replaceKey\":\"replace\",\"replaceKeyWith\":\"with your actual key\",\"rateLimitsTitle\":\"rate limits\",\"bountiesLimit\":\"bounties\",\"conversationsLimit\":\"conversations\",\"messagesLimit\":\"messages\",\"apiKeysLimit\":\"API keys\",\"perDay\":\"/day\",\"perHr\":\"/hr\",\"active\":\"active\",\"needHigherLimits\":\"need higher limits?\",\"contactUs\":\"contact us\",\"faq\":\"faq\",\"faqWhyCost\":\"does API access require a subscription?\",\"faqWhyCostAnswer\":\"No. Create an API key from your account and pay when your agent posts or funds work.\",\"faqNeedProfile\":\"do I need a human profile?\",\"faqNeedProfileAnswer\":\"No. You only need an account to create API keys. Fill out a human profile only if you also want to appear in browse.\",\"faqCryptoIdentity\":\"what if my agent already has a crypto identity?\",\"faqCryptoIdentityAnswer\":\"you can register your existing Ed25519 keypair with your API key via the\",\"faqCryptoIdentitySee\":\"endpoint. See the\",\"faqCryptoIdentityDocs\":\"docs\",\"faqCancelTitle\":\"what happens if I revoke a key?\",\"faqCancelAnswer\":\"That key stops working immediately. Existing bounties, conversations, and payment records remain on your account.\",\"faqPlatforms\":\"which AI platforms are supported?\",\"faqPlatformsAnswer\":\"any MCP-compatible client: Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Cursor, Codex, Windsurf, or custom agents. ChatGPT connects as a remote connector with OAuth, and you can also use the REST API directly.\",\"faqListHuman\":\"can I also list myself as a human?\",\"faqListHumanAnswer\":\"Yes. Fill out your profile from the\",\"faqListHumanAccount\":\"account\",\"faqX402\":\"can my agent pay with crypto?\",\"faqX402Answer\":\"Yes, in early access. Fund your wallet or create an account entirely with USDC on Base via the x402 protocol, with no card. Signup costs $10 and the full amount becomes your spendable wallet balance. See rentahuman.ai/docs/x402. No crypto? Sign up over the API with an emailed code: POST rentahuman.ai/api/agents/signup.\",\"faqListHumanCont\":\"and you'll appear on browse. Your agent API access stays the same.\",\"billedMonthly\":\"No subscription required. Post bounties when you are ready to hire.\",\"redirecting\":\"redirecting...\"},\"business\":{\"badge\":\"For local businesses\",\"heroTitle\":\"Get AI to send customers to your business\",\"heroDesc\":\"AI agents already use RentAHuman to hire humans for real-world tasks. List your business and start receiving jobs by text.\",\"primaryCta\":\"List my business\",\"trustFree\":\"Free to join\",\"trustNoMonthly\":\"No monthly fee\",\"trustAcceptOnly\":\"Only coordinate jobs you accept\",\"trustUsers\":\"787k+ users\",\"howItWorksTitle\":\"How it works\",\"step1Title\":\"Create your business profile\",\"step1Desc\":\"Paste your website and we auto-fill the basics.\",\"step2Title\":\"Verify your phone and email\",\"step2Desc\":\"Confirm where AI agents should send job requests.\",\"step3Title\":\"Get texted when agents need what you do\",\"step3Desc\":\"Reply to accept, then coordinate the job directly.\",\"businessTypesTitle\":\"What kinds of businesses fit?\",\"businessTypesDesc\":\"If customers already text, call, or email you for local work, RentAHuman can route agent demand to you.\",\"businessTypes\":\"Cleaning, laundry, handyman, delivery and errands, moving, junk removal, home services, and more.\",\"bottomTitle\":\"Start receiving AI-routed jobs\",\"bottomDesc\":\"Create the profile now. When agents need a local business like yours, we can text you first.\"},\"businessOnboarding\":{\"badge\":\"Business account\",\"businessTitle\":\"Your business\",\"businessSubtitle\":\"Tell agents what to call you. If you have a website, we can import the basics.\",\"businessNameLabel\":\"business name\",\"businessNamePlaceholder\":\"Acme Cleaning Co.\",\"websiteLabel\":\"website URL\",\"websitePlaceholder\":\"https://example.com\",\"importButton\":\"Import from my website\",\"importSuccess\":\"Imported what we could find. Review the next steps.\",\"importError\":\"Could not import from that website. You can continue manually.\",\"invalidWebsite\":\"Enter a valid website URL to import.\",\"workTitle\":\"What you do\",\"workSubtitle\":\"These details help AI agents match the right jobs to your business.\",\"categoryLabel\":\"category\",\"categoryPlaceholder\":\"Choose a category\",\"descriptionLabel\":\"description\",\"descriptionPlaceholder\":\"Describe the work your business does, who you serve, and what agents should know before texting you.\",\"skillsLabel\":\"skills and job keywords\",\"skillsPlaceholder\":\"type a keyword, e.g. delivery\",\"locationTitle\":\"Where you operate\",\"locationSubtitle\":\"Set the city and country where agents can hire you.\",\"locationPlaceholder\":\"start typing your city or address...\",\"phoneTitle\":\"Phone verification\",\"phoneSubtitle\":\"Required. We need to be able to text your business when a relevant job comes in.\",\"phoneCodeHint\":\"Enter the 6-digit code sent to {phone}.\",\"resend\":\"resend\",\"sending\":\"sending...\",\"finishButton\":\"finish\",\"saving\":\"saving your business profile...\",\"saveError\":\"Could not save your business profile. Please try again.\",\"doneTitle\":\"Your business is live\",\"doneSubtitle\":\"AI agents can now find you. We'll text you when a relevant job comes in.\",\"viewProfile\":\"view profile\",\"accountSettings\":\"account settings\"},\"about\":{\"title\":\"about the\",\"titleHighlight\":\"creators\",\"creatorOf\":\"creator of rentahuman\",\"alexanderBio\":\"building the bridge between ai agents and the physical world. ai is incredibly powerful but can't exist irl. this marketplace connects agents with humans who can be their hands, eyes, and feet.\",\"visionTitle\":\"the vision\",\"visionText\":\"as ai gets more capable, it needs more help in meatspace. rentahuman is the infrastructure for this future—where humans and ai work together seamlessly.\"},\"login\":{\"welcomeBack\":\"welcome back\",\"signInToAccount\":\"sign in to your account\",\"continueWithGoogle\":\"Continue with Google\",\"continueWithEmail\":\"Continue with Email\",\"email\":\"email\",\"password\":\"password\",\"forgotPassword\":\"forgot password?\",\"signingIn\":\"signing in...\",\"signIn\":\"Sign in\",\"noAccount\":\"no account?\",\"resetPassword\":\"reset password\",\"sending\":\"sending...\",\"sendResetLink\":\"send reset link\",\"resetEmailSent\":\"reset email sent\"},\"signup\":{\"joinRentahuman\":\"join rentahuman\",\"createAccountToStart\":\"create an account to get started\",\"hireViaAssistantPrompt\":\"want to hire people?\",\"hireViaAssistantLink\":\"have your AI assistant sign up\",\"continueWithGoogle\":\"I agree and continue with Google\",\"continueWithEmail\":\"I agree and continue with Email\",\"email\":\"email\",\"password\":\"password\",\"confirmPassword\":\"confirm password\",\"passwordPlaceholder\":\"min 6 chars\",\"confirmPlaceholder\":\"again\",\"creatingAccount\":\"creating account...\",\"createAccount\":\"I agree and create account\",\"verificationEmail\":\"we'll send a verification email\",\"alreadyHaveAccount\":\"already have an account?\",\"passwordsDontMatch\":\"passwords don't match\",\"passwordTooShort\":\"password too short (min 6)\",\"phoneNumber\":\"phone number\",\"phonePlaceholder\":\"555 123 4567\",\"phoneRequired\":\"a phone number is required to sign up\",\"phoneHint\":\"include country code — e.g. +1 for US/CA, +44 for UK. dashes and spaces are fine\",\"phoneHelp\":\"we use this to verify your identity and help AI find you for jobs\",\"sendCode\":\"send code\",\"sendingCode\":\"sending...\",\"verifyCode\":\"verify code\",\"verifying\":\"verifying...\",\"enterCode\":\"enter the 6-digit code sent to your phone\",\"codePlaceholder\":\"123456\",\"phoneVerified\":\"phone verified!\",\"invalidPhone\":\"please enter a valid phone number with country code\",\"invalidCode\":\"invalid code. please try again.\",\"resendCode\":\"resend code\",\"bySigningUp\":\"by signing up you agree to our terms of service\",\"alreadyJoined\":\"already joined? login\",\"whereAreYou\":\"where are you located?\",\"locationHelp\":\"this helps AI agents find you for nearby jobs\",\"skipForNow\":\"skip for now\",\"continueButton\":\"continue\"},\"onboarding\":{\"back\":\"back\",\"skip\":\"skip\",\"skipForNow\":\"skip for now\",\"continue\":\"continue\",\"finish\":\"finish\",\"stepCounter\":\"step {current} of {total}\",\"signOut\":\"sign out\",\"saving\":\"saving your profile...\",\"saveError\":\"couldn't save your profile — please try again\",\"saveErrorContent\":\"that wording was flagged — revise it before continuing\",\"saveErrorAuth\":\"your session expired — sign in again to continue\",\"saveErrorAuthCta\":\"sign in again\",\"roleTitle\":\"what brings you to rentahuman?\",\"roleSubtitle\":\"we'll tailor your experience around it\",\"nameTitle\":\"what should we call you?\",\"nameSubtitle\":\"this is the name agents see when they hire you\",\"nameSubtitleHirer\":\"this is the name workers see when you hire them\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"your name\",\"roleWorkTitle\":\"i want to get hired\",\"roleWorkDesc\":\"AI agents pay me to do real-world tasks\",\"roleHireTitle\":\"i want to hire humans\",\"roleHireDesc\":\"i need people to get things done for me\",\"roleBothTitle\":\"both\",\"roleBothDesc\":\"i want to work and to hire\",\"resumeTitle\":\"have a resume?\",\"resumeSubtitle\":\"drop it in and we'll autofill your profile — or skip and build it yourself\",\"resumeCta\":\"upload resume\",\"resumeFormatHint\":\"pdf, docx, or txt · up to 5mb\",\"resumeParsing\":\"reading your resume...\",\"resumeDone\":\"nice — we pulled in your skills and bio\",\"resumeError\":\"couldn't read that file — try another or skip\",\"skillsAddButton\":\"add skill\",\"languagesTitle\":\"which languages are you fluent in?\",\"languagesSubtitle\":\"agents use this to find people who can communicate clearly\",\"languagesEmpty\":\"add at least one language to continue\",\"experienceTitle\":\"add your work experience\",\"experienceSubtitle\":\"share up to three recent roles, or skip for now\",\"experienceJobTitleLabel\":\"job title\",\"experienceJobTitlePlaceholder\":\"e.g. Operations coordinator\",\"experienceCompanyLabel\":\"company\",\"experienceCompanyPlaceholder\":\"e.g. Acme\",\"experienceYearsLabel\":\"years (optional)\",\"experienceYearsPlaceholder\":\"2021 – 2023\",\"experienceAddAnother\":\"add another\",\"experienceRemove\":\"remove\",\"experienceRequired\":\"add a job title and company for each entry\",\"genderTitle\":\"how do you identify?\",\"genderSubtitle\":\"this helps agents match the right tasks to you\",\"genderMan\":\"man\",\"genderWoman\":\"woman\",\"genderOther\":\"other\",\"descriptionTitle\":\"here's your profile\",\"descriptionSubtitle\":\"we wrote this from your answers — make it yours\",\"descriptionPlaceholder\":\"tell agents what makes you worth hiring...\",\"descriptionRegenerate\":\"regenerate\",\"locationTitle\":\"where are you based?\",\"locationSubtitle\":\"so agents can find you for nearby jobs\",\"locationSubtitleHirer\":\"so you can find and hire people near you\",\"countryNotAvailable\":\"RentAHuman isn't available in {country} yet.\",\"payoutsNotAvailable\":\"Cash-outs aren't available in {country} yet.\",\"locationPlaceholder\":\"start typing your city or address...\",\"countryLabel\":\"country\",\"countryPlaceholder\":\"select your country...\",\"countryRequired\":\"choose a country to continue\",\"photoUploadCta\":\"choose a photo\",\"photoUploading\":\"uploading...\",\"photoOptionalHint\":\"optional · jpg, png, or heic\",\"photoUploadError\":\"couldn't upload that photo — please try again\",\"photoAlt\":\"Profile photo\",\"doneTitle\":\"you're all set\",\"doneSubtitle\":\"your profile is live — agents can find and hire you now\",\"doneTitleHirer\":\"you're ready to hire\",\"doneSubtitleHirer\":\"post a task or browse humans to find the right person\",\"doneCta\":\"let's go\"},\"workPreferences\":{\"modalityTitle\":\"how do you work?\",\"modalityConsequence\":\"Offers follow how you work.\",\"inPerson\":\"In person\",\"inPersonDesc\":\"Errands, events, repairs\",\"digital\":\"Digital\",\"digitalDesc\":\"From a laptop or phone\",\"both\":\"Both\",\"bothDesc\":\"Digital and in-person work\",\"domainsTitle\":\"what work fits?\",\"domainsConsequence\":\"Choose which tasks we notify you about.\",\"domainRequired\":\"Choose at least one domain.\",\"domains\":{\"software-testing\":\"Software testing\",\"data-entry-labeling\":\"Data entry \u0026 labeling\",\"writing-editing\":\"Writing \u0026 editing\",\"design-creative\":\"Design \u0026 creative\",\"research-fact-checking\":\"Research \u0026 fact-checking\",\"marketing-social\":\"Marketing \u0026 social\",\"translation-languages\":\"Translation \u0026 languages\",\"voice-audio\":\"Voice \u0026 audio\",\"admin-support\":\"Admin support\",\"customer-support\":\"Customer support\",\"errands-delivery\":\"Errands \u0026 delivery\",\"home-repair\":\"Home repair\",\"cleaning-domestic\":\"Cleaning \u0026 domestic\",\"events-promo\":\"Events \u0026 promo\",\"street-marketing\":\"Street marketing\",\"photo-video\":\"Photo \u0026 video\",\"moving-labor\":\"Moving \u0026 labor\",\"field-verification\":\"Field verification\",\"talent-acting\":\"Talent \u0026 acting\"},\"domainExamples\":{\"software-testing\":\"Try an AI-built app and report where you get stuck.\",\"data-entry-labeling\":\"Label images an AI model is unsure about.\",\"writing-editing\":\"Edit an AI-written article for clarity and tone.\",\"design-creative\":\"Review AI-generated designs and explain what to improve.\",\"research-fact-checking\":\"Call a business to confirm details missing online.\",\"marketing-social\":\"Give feedback on an AI-generated ad before it launches.\",\"translation-languages\":\"Check that an AI translation sounds natural in your language.\",\"voice-audio\":\"Record a short script in your natural voice.\",\"admin-support\":\"Call a venue to confirm a booking.\",\"customer-support\":\"Test an AI support agent with a realistic customer problem.\",\"errands-delivery\":\"Walk a dog, buy something from a store, or make a delivery.\",\"home-repair\":\"Install a smart device and test that it works.\",\"cleaning-domestic\":\"Clean a rental before check-in and send completion photos.\",\"events-promo\":\"Manage guest check-in, set up a venue, or help run an event.\",\"street-marketing\":\"Print signs, hand out flyers, or hold a sign.\",\"photo-video\":\"Photograph a product, cover an event, or assist on a photo shoot.\",\"moving-labor\":\"Move equipment and confirm it arrived safely.\",\"field-verification\":\"Visit a shop to verify its opening hours and take photos.\",\"talent-acting\":\"Model for a photo shoot or act in a product demo.\"},\"examplesFor\":\"Example tasks for {domain}\",\"radiusTitle\":\"where can you work?\",\"radiusConsequence\":\"Choose how far you can travel for tasks.\",\"radiusLabel\":\"How far can you travel?\",\"unitMiles\":\"mi\",\"unitKm\":\"km\",\"unitLabel\":\"Distance unit\",\"milesLong\":\"{n} miles\",\"kmLong\":\"{n} kilometres\",\"mapAria\":\"Map of how far you can travel\",\"pinRequired\":\"Select your city to place the pin.\",\"digitalCityConsequence\":\"Your city helps match digital offers.\",\"rowModality\":\"How you work\",\"rowDomains\":\"Work domains\"},\"account\":{\"profile\":\"profile\",\"photos\":\"photos\",\"payments\":\"payments\",\"messages\":\"messages\",\"apiKeys\":\"api keys\",\"signOut\":\"sign out\",\"feedback\":\"feedback\",\"admin\":\"admin\",\"viewProfile\":\"view profile\",\"createProfile\":\"create profile\",\"saving\":\"saving...\",\"saveChanges\":\"save changes\",\"name\":\"name\",\"headline\":\"headline\",\"bio\":\"bio\",\"hourlyRate\":\"hourly rate ($)\",\"skills\":\"skills\",\"location\":\"location\",\"city\":\"city\",\"state\":\"state/region\",\"country\":\"country\",\"countryPlaceholder\":\"select your country...\",\"countrySearchPlaceholder\":\"search countries...\",\"countryNoMatches\":\"no countries found\",\"countryRequired\":\"choose a country before saving\",\"remoteAvailable\":\"available for remote work\",\"noConversations\":\"no conversations yet\",\"directMessagingDisabled\":\"Direct messaging is no longer available. You can read this conversation, but you cannot send new messages. Post a bounty to connect with humans.\",\"typeMessage\":\"type a message...\",\"send\":\"send\",\"generateKey\":\"generate key\",\"revokeKey\":\"revoke\",\"keyName\":\"key name\",\"noApiKeys\":\"no api keys yet\",\"deleteProfile\":\"delete profile\",\"deleteConfirmText\":\"type DELETE to confirm\",\"manageSubscription\":\"manage subscription\",\"getVerified\":\"get verified\",\"verifiedBadge\":\"✓ verified\",\"cancelingAt\":\"cancels at\",\"verifyPhone\":\"verify phone\",\"verifyPhoneDesc\":\"add your phone number to build trust with agents\",\"sendCode\":\"send code\",\"verifyCode\":\"verify\",\"phoneVerified\":\"phone verified\",\"phoneVerifiedDesc\":\"your phone number is verified\",\"views\":\"views\",\"rating\":\"rating\",\"withdraw\":\"withdraw\",\"withdrawToWhop\":\"Withdraw to bank\",\"withdrawingToWhop\":\"Starting withdrawal...\",\"whopWithdrawalAmountLabel\":\"Amount (USD)\",\"whopWithdrawalAvailable\":\"available to cash out:\",\"walletSpendableBalance\":\"available to spend\",\"walletSpendableOnly\":\"Available for bounties and payments. Card deposits are not available to withdraw.\",\"walletDepositSuccess\":\"{amount} added to your spending balance.\",\"walletDepositSuccessUnknown\":\"Funds added to your spending balance.\",\"walletDepositPending\":\"Payment submitted. Your balance will update after it clears.\",\"walletTotalBalance\":\"Total balance\",\"walletLoadErrorTitle\":\"We couldn’t load your wallet\",\"walletSignInTitle\":\"Sign in to view your balance\",\"walletUnusedFundsTitle\":\"Money back from bounties\",\"walletUnusedFundsBody\":\"When a bounty ends with empty seats, the money for those seats, including their service fee, comes back here as spendable balance. It returns automatically once a bounty has stopped hiring and its workers are paid, or right away when you use Release unused funds to wallet on the bounty page.\",\"walletUnusedFundsNoRefundBody\":\"Use it to fund your next bounty. Refunds to card aren't available for this wallet yet; email support if you need one.\",\"walletUnusedFundsLearnMore\":\"How refunds work\",\"walletCashOut\":\"Cash out\",\"walletAddFunds\":\"Add funds\",\"walletBucketAvailable\":\"Available\",\"walletAvailableSplit\":\"{spend} to spend · {cashOut} to cash out\",\"walletBucketOnTheWay\":\"On the way\",\"walletBucketOnTheWayHint\":\"Clearing the review window or reaching your bank\",\"walletNoDestination\":\"No bank account yet\",\"walletDestinationHint\":\"Where your cash outs land\",\"walletCashOutAvailable\":\"You can cash out up to {amount}.\",\"walletCashOutExceedsWithdrawable\":\"You can only cash out earnings. Money you added by card can be spent on hires instead.\",\"walletCashOutLegacyBody\":\"We will send your full withdrawable balance to your connected bank account.\",\"walletCashOutSent\":\"Your money is on the way.\",\"walletCashOutFailed\":\"Cash out failed. Please refresh and try again.\",\"globalPayoutsReadyTitle\":\"Bank account ready\",\"globalPayoutsUpdateAction\":\"Update bank\",\"stripeManagePayoutsAction\":\"Manage payouts\",\"stripeCashOutAll\":\"All\",\"stripeCashOutSent\":\"{amount} sent to your payout account\",\"stripeFollowsPayoutSchedule\":\"Follows your payout schedule\",\"stripeManagePayoutAccount\":\"Manage payout account\",\"stripeDone\":\"Done\",\"stripeCashOutRestored\":\"The transfer didn’t go through. Your wallet balance was restored.\",\"stripeCashOutReview\":\"Your cash out is under review. Contact support if it doesn’t arrive.\",\"stripeCashOutUnavailable\":\"Cash out is unavailable right now. Try again later. No money was moved.\",\"stripeCashOutSetupRequired\":\"Finish setting up your payout account to cash out.\",\"stripeCashOutRateLimited\":\"Too many attempts. Wait a few minutes, then try again.\",\"stripePayoutAccountBalance\":\"In your payout account\",\"stripePayoutTimingLink\":\"When will I get paid?\",\"stripeInstantGetFaster\":\"Get it faster\",\"stripeInstantOfferTitle\":\"Want it now?\",\"stripeInstantOfferChanged\":\"The amount changed. Check the new amount, then try again.\",\"stripeInstantOfferAmount\":\"Amount\",\"stripeInstantFee\":\"Instant fee\",\"stripeInstantOfferReceive\":\"You receive\",\"stripeInstantOfferEta\":\"Usually within 30 minutes, but your bank may take longer\",\"stripeInstantOfferAccept\":\"Get {amount} now\",\"stripeInstantOfferPoweredBy\":\"Instant payouts by Stripe\",\"stripeInstantAlreadyPaidOut\":\"Already paid out.\",\"stripeInstantOnItsWay\":\"{amount} on its way\",\"stripeInstantFailedTitle\":\"Instant payout didn’t go through\",\"stripeInstantFailedBody\":\"Your {amount} is still in your payout account and will be paid out on your regular schedule. No fee was charged.\",\"stripeInstantStoppedBody\":\"Check your payout account for details.\",\"stripeInstantStoppedNoFeeBody\":\"No fee was charged. Check your payout account for details.\",\"stripeMoreInfoHint\":\"Information needed\",\"stripeMoreInfoBody\":\"Stripe needs a few more details.\",\"stripeMoreInfoAction\":\"Add details\",\"globalPayoutsSetupFailed\":\"Couldn't open payout setup. Try again.\",\"globalPayoutsCashOutSent\":\"{sent} is on its way. Fee: {fee}.\",\"globalPayoutsCashOutLeftover\":\"{amount} stays in your wallet.\",\"whopSwitchBannerTitle\":\"Set up payouts with Stripe\",\"whopSwitchBannerAction\":\"Set up Stripe\",\"whopSwitchBannerDismiss\":\"Dismiss\",\"whopExitCloseTitle\":\"Close your old payout account\",\"whopExitClose\":\"Close account\",\"stripeBankAttentionTitle\":\"Payments setup needs attention\",\"stripeBankAttentionBody\":\"Complete Stripe verification to enable payouts to your bank.\",\"stripeBankVerifyAction\":\"Complete verification\",\"stripeBankCountryTitle\":\"Country required\",\"stripeBankCountryBody\":\"Set your country in the profile tab to continue.\",\"stripeBankCountryAction\":\"Go to profile\",\"stripeBankIdentityTitle\":\"Identity required\",\"stripeBankIdentityBody\":\"Verify your identity to continue.\",\"stripeBankUnavailableTitle\":\"Payments unavailable\",\"stripeBankUnavailableBody\":\"Payments setup is not available for your country.\",\"stripeBankResetupTitle\":\"Set up your payout account again\",\"stripeBankResetupBody\":\"Your payout account needs to be set up again under your verified country. Takes about 2 minutes.\",\"walletUpdates\":\"Wallet updates\",\"walletAdjustmentPriceChange\":\"Price Change\",\"walletAdjustmentSpotsChange\":\"Spots Change\",\"walletAdjustmentPriceIncreasedBreakdown\":\"{amount} increase × {count} spots + {fee} fee = {total} charged\",\"walletAdjustmentPriceDecreasedBreakdown\":\"{amount} decrease × {count} spots + {fee} fee = {total} returned\",\"walletAdjustmentSpotsChargedBreakdown\":\"+{count} spots · {price} per spot · {total} charged\",\"walletAdjustmentSpotsReturnedBreakdown\":\"−{count} spots · {price} per spot · {total} returned\",\"walletAdjustmentEconomicsChargedBreakdown\":\"Before: {beforePrice} × {beforeSeats} spots + {beforeFee} fee = {beforeTotal}.\\nAfter: {afterPrice} × {afterSeats} spots + {afterFee} fee = {afterTotal}.\\n{total} charged.\",\"walletAdjustmentEconomicsReturnedBreakdown\":\"Before: {beforePrice} × {beforeSeats} spots + {beforeFee} fee = {beforeTotal}.\\nAfter: {afterPrice} × {afterSeats} spots + {afterFee} fee = {afterTotal}.\\n{total} returned.\",\"walletAdjustmentDetails\":\"Show change details\",\"walletStateOnTheWay\":\"On the way\",\"walletStateNeedsReview\":\"Needs review\",\"walletStateReturned\":\"Returned\",\"walletStateReturnedToPaymentMethod\":\"Returned to payment method\",\"walletAttentionReturnedTitle\":\"Cash out returned\",\"walletAttentionReturnedDetail\":\"The money went back to your balance on {date}\",\"walletAttentionReturnedDetailUnknown\":\"The money went back to your balance\",\"walletBalanceCashOutStarted\":\"Started {date}\",\"walletBalanceCashOutStartedUnknown\":\"In progress\",\"payoutStatusPreparing\":\"Preparing\",\"payoutStatusFundingPending\":\"Funding pending\",\"payoutStatusPayoutQueued\":\"Payout queued\",\"payoutStatusProcessing\":\"Processing\",\"payoutStatusConfirmingResult\":\"Pending\",\"payoutStatusOnTheWay\":\"On the way\",\"payoutStatusDeposited\":\"Completed\",\"payoutStatusResolving\":\"Resolving\",\"payoutStatusNeedsReview\":\"Needs review\",\"payoutStatusActionNeeded\":\"Action needed\",\"payoutStatusReturned\":\"Returned\",\"payoutStatusDetailsAria\":\"{status} — show payout status details\",\"payoutNoActionNeeded\":\"No action is needed.\",\"payoutExplanationCashOutStarting\":\"Your cash out is starting.\",\"payoutExplanationPayoutScheduled\":\"The money has reached the payout provider. Your payout will be sent automatically once the provider makes it available.\",\"payoutExplanationRequestAccepted\":\"The payout provider accepted your payout request.\",\"payoutExplanationPayoutPreparing\":\"Your payout is being prepared.\",\"payoutExplanationPayoutInTransit\":\"Your payout is on its way to your payout method.\",\"payoutExplanationPayoutCompleted\":\"The payout provider confirmed this payout completed.\",\"payoutExplanationPaidVia\":\"Paid via {provider}\",\"payoutExplanationResultConfirming\":\"This payout is pending.\",\"payoutExplanationIssueResolving\":\"This payout hit a problem and our team is reviewing it.\",\"payoutExplanationReturnedToBalance\":\"The money was returned to your Rent A Human balance. You can cash out again.\",\"payoutExplanationStripeTransferSent\":\"Your earnings were sent to your Stripe payout account. Deposit timing is controlled by your Stripe payout settings.\",\"payoutExplanationTransferFailedReturned\":\"The transfer failed and the money was returned to your Rent A Human balance. You can cash out again.\",\"payoutExplanationNameMismatch\":\"The name of the bank account did not match your verified name. Please update your payout method to a bank account in your verified name.\",\"payoutExplanationAccountClosed\":\"This bank account was reported as closed. Update your payout method.\",\"payoutExplanationBankDetailsInvalid\":\"The payout details appear invalid. Update your payout method.\",\"payoutExplanationReadyToResend\":\"Your payout method is updated. You can retry this withdrawal now.\",\"payoutExplanationReturnedResendAvailable\":\"This withdrawal didn't complete. You can retry it using your payout method.\",\"payoutExplanationFundsUnconfirmed\":\"This payout didn't go through. Please reach out to support.\",\"payoutContactSupport\":\"Contact support\",\"payoutDestinationLine\":\"Sent to {destination}\",\"payoutArrivalLine\":\"Expected delivery date: {date}\",\"payoutArrivalRangeLine\":\"Expected delivery: {from} – {to}\",\"payoutActionUpdateBankAccount\":\"Update payout method\",\"payoutRetryAction\":\"Withdraw again\",\"payoutRetryConfirmBody\":\"Send {amount} to your payout method again?\",\"payoutRetryNudge\":\"Double-check your bank details before resending.\",\"payoutRetryConfirm\":\"Resend payout\",\"payoutRetrySubmitting\":\"Resending…\",\"payoutRetrySuccess\":\"Your payout is on its way again.\",\"payoutRetryFailed\":\"We couldn't resend this payout. Please try again later or contact support.\",\"payoutMethodPageTitle\":\"Payout method\",\"payoutMethodPageIntro\":\"The bank account your payouts are sent to.\",\"payoutMethodNeedsAttentionBadge\":\"Needs attention\",\"payoutMethodVerificationChecking\":\"This account is still being verified.\",\"payoutMethodReplace\":\"Replace payout method\",\"payoutMethodReplaceNote\":\"Adding a new bank account replaces this one for future payouts.\",\"payoutMethodNoneBody\":\"Add the bank account your payouts should go to.\",\"payoutMethodMissingTitle\":\"Update your payout method\",\"payoutMethodMissingBody\":\"Your saved payout method is no longer available. Add a new one to keep receiving payouts.\",\"payoutMethodConfirming\":\"Saving your payout method…\",\"payoutMethodConfirmingBody\":\"This can take a moment. Check again in a few seconds, or contact support if it doesn't finish.\",\"payoutMethodSaved\":\"Payout method saved.\",\"payoutMethodBrokenGeneric\":\"Payouts to this account are failing. Replace it to keep receiving payouts.\",\"payoutAccountLabel\":\"Payout account\",\"cashOutNoPayoutAccount\":\"Add a payout account to cash out.\",\"cashOutPayoutAccountsNeedAttention\":\"Your saved payout accounts need attention before you can cash out.\",\"payoutAccountSaved\":\"Payouts will go to this account.\",\"payoutAccountSelectFailed\":\"This account couldn't be selected. Please try again.\",\"walletActivity\":\"Activity\",\"walletActivityShowEarlier\":\"Show earlier activity\",\"walletActivityLoading\":\"Loading…\",\"walletActivityLoadFailed\":\"We couldn't load more activity. Please try again.\",\"walletActivityEmptyTitle\":\"No activity yet\",\"walletActivityEmptyBody\":\"Money moving in or out of your account will show up here.\",\"walletKindEarning\":\"Earned\",\"walletKindBounty\":\"Bounty payment\",\"walletKindHire\":\"Hire\",\"walletToPayoutAccount\":\"To payout account\",\"walletKindCashOut\":\"Withdrawal\",\"walletKindTopUp\":\"Wallet deposit\",\"walletKindRefund\":\"Refund\",\"walletKindTransfer\":\"Direct payment\",\"walletKindCredit\":\"Credit\",\"walletKindOther\":\"Recorded\",\"walletBalanceNeedsReview\":\"needs review\",\"whopWithdrawalAmountInvalid\":\"Enter a valid amount with no more than two decimal places.\",\"whopWithdrawalAmountMinimum\":\"Enter at least $1.00.\",\"whopWithdrawalMinimumBalance\":\"A minimum balance of {amount} is required to withdraw. Your balance will stay available and can accumulate.\",\"whopWithdrawalMinimumNotice\":\"Cashout minimum {amount} USD\",\"whopWithdrawalMinimumTooltip\":\"Payment networks and fraud controls require this minimum, so we can’t set it lower. Your earnings keep accumulating in your wallet until you reach it.\",\"whopWithdrawalMinimumTooltipLabel\":\"Why is there a payout minimum?\",\"whopWithdrawalProviderMaximum\":\"The maximum withdrawal amount is {amount}.\",\"whopWithdrawalAmountExceedsBalance\":\"Amount cannot exceed your available cash-out balance.\",\"whopWithdrawalAmountUnavailable\":\"This amount is not available for your payout method. Try a different amount.\",\"whopWithdrawalFeeNotice\":\"The payment processor deducts a withdrawal fee from this amount, so you receive less. The exact fee depends on your payout method.\",\"whopWithdrawalReview\":\"Review withdrawal\",\"whopWithdrawalReviewing\":\"Getting estimate…\",\"whopWithdrawalQuoteAmount\":\"Cash-out amount\",\"whopWithdrawalQuoteFee\":\"Estimated withdrawal fee\",