mitted — usually takes a few minutes\",\"whopEnrollmentFailed\":\"Payout setup could not be started. Please try again later.\",\"walletPayoutAttentionTitle\":\"Payouts need your attention\",\"walletRfiAttentionBody\":\"Your identity verification needs more information before you can cash out.\",\"walletRfiAttentionAction\":\"Review\",\"verificationRequestsTitle\":\"Verification requests\",\"verificationRequestsIntro\":\"We need the following information to keep payouts enabled. Documents are sent securely to our verification partner and are never stored by Rent A Human.\",\"verificationRequestsLoadFailed\":\"Verification requests could not be loaded.\",\"verificationRequestsNone\":\"Nothing needs your attention right now.\",\"verificationRequestsUnderReview\":\"Everything is submitted. Your verification is under review — this usually takes a few minutes.\",\"verificationRequestsApproved\":\"Your verification is complete.\",\"verificationRequestsSubmit\":\"Submit\",\"verificationRequestsSubmitting\":\"Submitting…\",\"verificationRequestsSubmitFailed\":\"Your answers could not be submitted. Try again.\",\"verificationRequestsUploadsInvalid\":\"Your document uploads are no longer valid. Upload them again, then submit your answers.\",\"verificationRequestsAnswerRejected\":\"An answer was not accepted. Review the requirements above and try again.\",\"verificationRequestsOptionalBadge\":\"Optional\",\"verificationRequestsRejectedNotice\":\"Returned for another look:\",\"verificationRequestsUploading\":\"Uploading…\",\"verificationRequestsUploadFailed\":\"The document could not be uploaded. Try again.\",\"verificationRequestsRemoveFile\":\"Remove\",\"verificationRequestsFileHint\":\"JPEG, PNG, or PDF, up to 4 MB.\",\"verificationRequestsPagesHint\":\"Add pages in order for multi-page documents.\",\"verificationRequestsSupportNotice\":\"Some requests cannot be completed here. Email us and we will sort them out.\",\"verificationRequestsPhoneHint\":\"Include the country code,