g begins once the bank transfer starts.\",\"moneyActivityBankProcessing\":\"Bank withdrawal processing\",\"moneyActivityBankTimingUnavailable\":\"The bank withdrawal has started. The provider did not record an arrival estimate.\",\"moneyActivityUnderReview\":\"Under review\",\"moneyActivityReviewTiming\":\"The outcome is not confirmed. The funds stay reserved and cannot be sent twice.\",\"moneyActivityNeedsAttention\":\"Needs payout attention\",\"moneyActivityNeedsAttentionTiming\":\"Your funds are safe, but the bank transfer needs attention. Contact support before retrying.\",\"moneyActivitySettled\":\"Settled\",\"moneyActivityReturned\":\"Returned to balance\",\"moneyActivityRecorded\":\"Recorded\",\"moneyActivityTimingUnavailable\":\"Timing unavailable in the recorded data.\",\"moneyActivityWhopWithdrawal\":\"Wallet withdrawal\",\"moneyActivityBankWithdrawal\":\"Bank cash out\",\"moneyActivityBountyNamed\":\"Bounty: {title}\",\"moneyActivityBounty\":\"Bounty payment\",\"moneyActivityWhopTopUp\":\"Wallet top-up\",\"moneyActivityTopUp\":\"Wallet top-up\",\"moneyActivityWithdrawalRestored\":\"Withdrawal restored\",\"moneyActivityRefund\":\"Refund\",\"moneyActivityEarningNamed\":\"Earnings: {title}\",\"moneyActivityEarning\":\"Earnings credited\",\"moneyActivityTransferNamed\":\"Payment to {counterparty}\",\"moneyActivityTransfer\":\"Direct payment\",\"moneyStepPayment\":\"Payment\",\"moneyStepWallet\":\"Wallet\",\"moneyStepBounty\":\"Bounty\",\"moneyStepBank\":\"Bank\",\"moneyStepEscrow\":\"Escrow\",\"moneyStepTasker\":\"Tasker\",\"moneyStepWhop\":\"Withdrawal\",\"moneyStepRecipient\":\"Recipient\",\"moneyStepReview\":\"Review\",\"tabSettings\":\"settings\",\"tabServices\":\"services\",\"tabWallet\":\"wallet\",\"tabReferrals\":\"referrals\",\"identityCheckTitle\":\"Identity check\",\"identityCheckIntro\":\"Verify your ID once to apply to bounties that require it.\",\"identityCheckReturnBanner\":\"You’re verifying to apply for a bounty. We’ll send you back when you’r