p to jump the recording to that moment.\",\"empty\":\"The transcript has no segments.\"},\"aiRecommendation\":{\"title\":\"AI recommendation\",\"recommendApprove\":\"Recommends approval\",\"recommendRevise\":\"Recommends revision\",\"recommendReject\":\"Recommends rejection\",\"noRecommendation\":\"No specific recommendation was recorded\",\"pendingOwner\":\"Recommendation only · your decision is pending\",\"pendingAdmin\":\"Recommendation only · awaiting our team’s decision\",\"finalDecision\":\"Final AI decision\",\"finalApproved\":\"Final outcome · approved\",\"finalRejected\":\"Final outcome · not accepted\",\"finalRevision\":\"Final outcome · revision requested\",\"overturned\":\"AI recommendation overturned by human review\",\"recommendationHistorical\":\"The AI recommendation below is kept for the record; the final outcome above is what was applied.\",\"provisionalExplainer\":\"This is the AI reviewer’s recommendation, not a final result. Payment stays held until a person decides.\",\"reasonTitle\":\"Recommended reason\",\"limitationsTitle\":\"What the AI could not fully verify\",\"holdExplainer\":\"A person is reviewing this submission before payment; the AI recommendation above is not a decision.\",\"decisionReasonTitle\":\"Decision reason\"},\"tasteBallot\":{\"title\":\"Cast your vote\",\"openFull\":\"Open full size\",\"feedbackLabel\":\"Why this one? (required)\",\"authorshipInstruction\":\"Write your feedback yourself, in your own words. Your write-up must not be written by AI. Votes flagged as AI-written by our authorship check are automatically rejected and will not be paid.\",\"feedbackPlaceholder\":\"What specifically makes your pick stronger than the others?\",\"feedbackTooShort\":\"Add a couple of sentences of specific feedback — that is what gets paid.\",\"videoReminder\":\"This vote also requires a recorded video response — attach it in this chat before submitting.\",\"selectOption\":\"Pick one option to vote.\",\"submit\":\"Submit vote\",\"submitting\":\"Submitting vote…\",\"sendFailed\":\"Your vote could not be sent. Please try again.\",\"voiceTitle\":\"Voice note (required)\",\"voiceInstruction\":\"Record a short voice note saying which option you picked and why. Buyers hear it as proof a real person did this work.\",\"voiceRecord\":\"Record voice note\",\"voiceReRecord\":\"Re-record\",\"voiceStop\":\"Stop recording\",\"voiceRecording\":\"Recording… speak now\",\"voiceRequired\":\"Record your voice note to submit.\",\"voiceMicUnavailable\":\"Microphone unavailable. Allow mic access in your browser and try again.\"},\"workerSubmission\":{\"requirementsAction\":\"Requirements\",\"moreActions\":\"More task actions\",\"task\":{\"title\":\"Submit completed work\",\"instructions\":\"After completing the task, send the required evidence and a clear account of what you did, then submit the delivery. You can message the poster, ask for pickup details, or report a problem before completing the task.\",\"requirementsAcceptedDescription\":\"Your spot is confirmed. Use this chat for questions and updates. Submit the required evidence after the task is complete.\",\"submit\":\"Submit completed work\",\"reportIssueDescription\":\"Describe the blocker here. The report is visible to support and the poster in chat. Deadline enforcement pauses for up to 48 hours; an overdue spot may then be released without a rating.\",\"issueOpenTitle\":\"Problem reported\",\"issueOpenDescription\":\"Your report is visible in chat and the support queue. Deadline enforcement pauses for up to 48 hours, then an overdue spot may be released without a rating. Mark resolved when the blocker is addressed, then submit completed work with the required evidence.\",\"resolvingIssue\":\"Resolving…\",\"issueResolved\":\"Problem marked resolved. You can continue your task.\"},\"job\":{\"notAccepted\":\"Submission not accepted · unpaid\",\"rejectionInstructions\":\"This job has ended. Payment was not released, and your spot was reopened for someone else