:\"Could not cancel this assignment.\",\"declined\":\"User testing offer declined\",\"cancelled\":\"User testing assignment cancelled\",\"released\":\"Seat released — no fault of yours\",\"releasedInstructions\":\"We couldn't deliver your start instructions, so this tester spot was released. No review was recorded and this doesn't affect your standing.\",\"reportIssue\":\"Report issue\",\"reportIssueTitle\":\"Report a blocking issue\",\"reportIssueDescription\":\"Describe the blocker here. The report is visible to support and the poster in chat. Deadline enforcement pauses for up to 48 hours; an overdue spot may then be released without a rating.\",\"reportIssuePlaceholder\":\"Describe what is blocking you and what you have already tried…\",\"submitIssueReport\":\"Send report\",\"reportingIssue\":\"Sending…\",\"issueReported\":\"Issue reported — saved in chat and the support queue.\",\"issueReportFailed\":\"Could not send the issue report.\",\"issueOpenTitle\":\"Issue reported\",\"issueOpenDescription\":\"Your report is visible in chat and the support queue. Deadline enforcement pauses for up to 48 hours, then an overdue spot may be released without a rating. Mark resolved when the blocker is addressed, then submit completed work with the required evidence.\",\"markIssueResolved\":\"Mark resolved\",\"resolvingIssue\":\"Resuming…\",\"issueResolved\":\"Issue marked resolved — deadline enforcement resumed.\",\"chatEvidenceSelection\":\"{count} files · choose up to {max} for review\",\"chatEvidenceSelected\":\"{selected} of {count} files picked for review\",\"chatEvidenceChoose\":\"Choose files\",\"reportForm\":{\"title\":\"QA Report\",\"backToChat\":\"Chat\",\"stepReport\":\"Report\",\"stepEvidence\":\"Attachments\",\"stepFindings\":\"Findings\",\"stepItems\":\"Test items\",\"stepInstructions\":\"Instructions\",\"stepOf\":\"Step {current} of {total}\",\"instructionsTitle\":\"Build the report in order\",\"instructionsLead\":\"Each part points at the one before it. Come 