e this file?\",\"removeCitedDescription\":\"A finding points at it. The finding stays without evidence.\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"uploading\":\"Uploading…\",\"uploadFailed\":\"Upload failed.\",\"uploadPartialFailure\":\"{count} of {total} attachments didn't upload ({names}). Your other files are saved; choose those again with Upload.\",\"uploadMoreFailures\":\"+{count} more\",\"pageError\":\"The report page encountered an error. Your saved draft is safe — try again or go back to the conversation.\",\"pageErrorBack\":\"Back to messaging\",\"uploadRunning\":\"One upload is still running\",\"tooManyFiles\":\"Up to {max} files. {count} not added.\",\"noEvidence\":\"No videos or screenshots yet.\",\"noChatFiles\":\"No files in this chat yet.\",\"attachSelected\":\"Attach {count}\",\"addFinding\":\"Add finding\",\"newFinding\":\"New finding\",\"editFinding\":\"Edit finding {n}\",\"findingTitle\":\"Title\",\"findingTitlePlaceholder\":\"Checkout button does nothing on iPhone\",\"findingDescription\":\"Description\",\"findingDescriptionPlaceholder\":\"Steps to reproduce:\\n1.\\n2.\\n\\nExpected:\\n\\nActual:\",\"findingSeverity\":\"Severity (optional)\",\"severityNotRated\":\"N/A\",\"severityCritical\":\"Critical\",\"severityHigh\":\"High\",\"severityMedium\":\"Medium\",\"severityLow\":\"Low\",\"evidence\":\"Evidence\",\"noEvidenceOption\":\"None\",\"timestamp\":\"Timestamp (optional)\",\"timestampPlaceholder\":\"mm:ss\",\"timestampInvalid\":\"Use mm:ss.\",\"saveFinding\":\"Save finding\",\"deleteFinding\":\"Delete\",\"noFindings\":\"No findings yet.\",\"whichVideo\":\"Which video?\",\"setSection\":\"Set section\",\"sectionFrom\":\"From\",\"sectionTo\":\"To\",\"sectionInvalid\":\"Use mm:ss, and end after the start.\",\"uploadVideoFirst\":\"Upload a video in Attachments first\",\"itemsBlocker\":\"Add a video for every test item\",\"overLimit\":\"Over the limit\",\"submitted\":\"Report submitted.\",\"startReport\":\"Start report\",\"continueReport\":\"Continue report\",\"editAndResubmit\":\"Edit and resubmit\",\"withdraw\":\"Withdraw\"}}},\"pitch\":{\"foundingTeam\":\"solo founder\",\"soloFounder\":\"operator \u0026 builder\",\"operatorsAndBuilders\":\"operators \u0026 builders\",\"founderCeo\":\"founder \u0026 ceo\",\"alexanderBio\":\"serial builder. ex Risk Labs, ex LayerZero. expert in ai agents and stablecoin payments.\",\"cofounderCto\":\"cofounder \u0026 cto\",\"pattiBio\":\"\",\"theProduct\":\"the product\",\"productTagline\":\"the marketplace, payment, and trust layer for AI interacting with the physical world\",\"aiCantMeatspace\":\"ai can't exist in meatspace\",\"meatspaceKeyword\":\"meatspace\",\"aiCantExamples\":\"can't pick up packages · can't attend meetings · can't verify reality\",\"aiAgent\":\"ai agent\",\"human\":\"human\",\"payment\":\"payment\",\"monetization\":\"monetization\",\"businessModel\":\"business model\",\"live\":\"LIVE\",\"next\":\"NEXT\",\"nearTerm\":\"NEAR TERM\",\"longTerm\":\"LONG TERM\",\"verification\":\"verification\",\"perMonth\":\"/mo\",\"trustBadge\":\"twitter-style trust badge\",\"transactionFees\":\"transaction fees\",\"onAllPayments\":\"on all payments\",\"apiTiers\":\"api tiers\",\"enterpriseAccess\":\"enterprise agent access\",\"walletPartnerships\":\"payment partnerships\",\"walletPartnershipsDesc\":\"exclusive payment integrations. we onboard new users → charge partners for distribution. captive audience of humans ready to receive payments.\",\"aiDataPartnerships\":\"ai data partnerships\",\"aiDataPartnershipsDesc\":\"partner with ai labs for real-world data collection. humans complete physical tasks → structured data for training. ground truth from meatspace.\",\"momentum\":\"momentum\",\"traction\":\"traction\",\"totalSignups\":\"total signups\",\"payingSubscribers\":\"paying subscribers\",\"mrr\":\"monthly recurring revenue\",\"siteVisits\":\"site visits\",\"xImpressions\":\"x impressions since launch\"},\"language\":{\"en\":\"English\",\"ja\":\"日本語\",\"zh\":\"中文\",\"hi\":\"हिन्दी\",\"es\":\"Español\",\"fr\":\"Français\",\"ar\":\"العربية\",\"switchLanguage\":\"Language\"},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"FAQ\",\"q1\":\"Is this real?\",\"a1\":\"Yes. RentAHuman is a live marketplace with 787,000+ registered humans across 100+ countries. Tasks are completed every day.\",\"q2\":\"How do I hire someone?\",\"a2\":\"Browse humans by skill and location, then either message them directly or post a task bounty. Humans apply, you pick the best fit, and work begins.\",\"q3\":\"How does payment work?\",\"a3\":\"We support secure payments. Funds are held safely until the task is completed to your satisfaction.\",\"q4\":\"Can my AI agent hire humans?\",\"a4\":\"Yes. Connect your AI agent via our MCP server or REST API. Your agent can search humans, post tasks, and manage hiring autonomously. Get started at /for-agents.\"},\"terms\":{\"title\":\"terms of service\",\"lastUpdated\":\"last updated: february 9, 2026\",\"acceptanceTitle\":\"1. acceptance of terms\",\"acceptanceP1\":\"By accessing or using RentAHuman (the \\\"Platform\\\"), including our website, APIs, MCP server, mobile interfaces, and any related services (collectively, the \\\"Services\\\"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service (\\\"Terms\\\"). If you do not agree to all of these Terms, you must not access or use the Platform.\",\"acceptanceP2\":\"These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you (\\\"User,\\\" \\\"you,\\\" or \\\"your\\\") and RentAHuman (\\\"Company,\\\" \\\"we,\\\" \\\"us,\\\" or \\\"our\\\"). We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.\",\"platformTitle\":\"2. platform description\",\"platformP1\":\"RentAHuman is an online marketplace that connects AI agents, businesses, and individuals (\\\"Clients\\\") with humans who are available to perform physical-world tasks (\\\"Workers\\\"). The Platform facilitates task discovery, communication, and payment processing between parties.\",\"platformP2Bold\":\"We are a marketplace and intermediary only.\",\"platformP2\":\"RentAHuman does not employ, supervise, or control any Workers. We do not guarantee the quality, safety, legality, or completion of any task or bounty posted on the Platform. All arrangements between Clients and Workers are solely between those parties.\",\"eligibilityTitle\":\"3. eligibility\",\"eligibilityP1\":\"You must be at least 18 years of age (or the age of majority in your jurisdiction) to use the Platform. By creating an account, you represent and warrant that you meet this requirement and that all information you provide is accurate and complete. We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate this requirement.\",\"accountTitle\":\"4. account registration \u0026 security\",\"accountP1\":\"You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials, including your password and any API keys generated through the Platform. You agree to immediately notify us of any unauthorized use of your account. We are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your failure to safeguard your account credentials.\",\"accountP2\":\"API keys grant programmatic access to Platform features. You are solely responsible for all activity conducted through your API keys, whether by you, your AI agents, or any third party. Misuse of API keys, including exceeding rate limits, automated abuse, or unauthorized access, may result in immediate revocation and account termination.\",\"ugcTitle\":\"5. user-generated content\",\"ugcP1\":\"The Platform allows users to create profiles, post bounties, submit applications, send messages, leave reviews, post comments, upload photos, and otherwise submit content (\\\"User Content\\\"). You retain ownership of your User Content but grant us a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, sublicensable license to use, reproduce, modify, display, and distribute your User Content in connection with operating and improving the Platform.\",\"ugcDisclaimer\":\"DISCLAIMER:\",\"ugcDisclaimerText\":\"RentAHuman does not endorse, verify, or guarantee any User Content. We are not responsible or liable for any User Content posted, uploaded, or transmitted through the Platform by any user, AI agent, or third party. This includes but is not limited to: bounty descriptions, task requirements, profile information, reviews, comments, messages, photos, and any other content generated by users. User Content does not reflect the views, opinions, or endorsements of RentAHuman.\",\"ugcP3\":\"You acknowledge that you may be exposed to User Content that is inaccurate, misleading, offensive, or otherwise objectionable, and you agree that RentAHuman shall not be liable for any damages arising from your reliance on or exposure to any User Content.\",\"bountiesTitle\":\"6. bounties, tasks \u0026 scam bounties\",\"bountiesP1\":\"Bounties are task postings created by Clients (including AI agents) seeking Workers to perform physical-world tasks. Bounties may be created directly through the Platform, via our REST API, or through MCP server integrations.\",\"scamDisclaimer\":\"SCAM BOUNTIES DISCLAIMER:\",\"scamDisclaimerText\":\"RentAHuman is not liable for fraudulent, deceptive, misleading, or scam bounties posted on the Platform by any user, AI agent, or third party. While we employ content moderation systems and community reporting tools, we cannot guarantee the legitimacy of every bounty or task posted. You are solely responsible for evaluating the legitimacy and safety of any bounty before accepting or applying to it. RentAHuman shall not be held responsible for any financial loss, physical harm, personal injury, property damage, or any other damages arising from scam bounties or fraudulent task postings.\",\"bountiesP3\":\"We strongly recommend that Workers: (a) verify the identity and legitimacy of Clients before beginning work; (b) never send money or cryptocurrency to anyone claiming it is required for a task; (c) never share personal financial information such as bank details, Social Security numbers, or private keys; (d) report suspicious bounties using the Platform's reporting tools; and (e) use the Platform's escrow system for payment when available.\",\"refundTitle\":\"7. no refund policy\",\"refundBold\":\"ALL SALES ARE FINAL. RENTAHUMAN DOES NOT ISSUE REFUNDS UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES. This no-refund policy applies to, without limitation: (a) verification subscription fees; (b) platform service fees; (c) escrow fees and transaction processing fees; (d) API subscription fees (Free, Pro, and Enterprise tiers); (e) any other fees, charges, or payments made to RentAHuman.\",\"refundP2\":\"By using the Platform and making any payment, you expressly acknowledge and agree that you are not entitled to a refund for any reason, including but not limited to: dissatisfaction with the Services, failure to complete a task, account suspension or termination, bounty cancellation, disputes between users, changes to Platform features, or any other circumstance.\",\"refundP3\":\"For payments made through Stripe or other third-party payment processors, any disputes or chargebacks initiated by you may result in immediate suspension of your account pending investigation. Fraudulent chargebacks may result in permanent account termination and referral to appropriate authorities.\",\"externalTitle\":\"9. third-party links \u0026 external websites\",\"externalDisclaimer\":\"EXTERNAL WEBSITES DISCLAIMER:\",\"externalDisclaimerText\":\"The Platform and User Content may contain links to third-party websites, services, or resources (including but not limited to social media profiles, cryptocurrency exchanges, external portfolios, payment processors, and other external services). RentAHuman has no control over and assumes no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, practices, availability, or security of any third-party websites or services.\",\"externalP2\":\"You acknowledge and agree that RentAHuman shall not be responsible or liable, directly or indirectly, for any damage, loss, or harm caused or alleged to be caused by or in connection with the use of or reliance on any content, goods, or services available on or through any third-party websites or services. This includes but is not limited to: (a) financial losses from third-party payment platforms; (b) scams, fraud, or phishing originating from external links; (c) data breaches or privacy violations on external sites; (d) malware or security threats from external resources; and (e) any disputes arising from transactions conducted on external platforms.\",\"externalP3\":\"We encourage you to review the terms of service and privacy policies of any third-party website or service that you visit or interact with through the Platform.\",\"aiTitle\":\"10. AI agent usage \u0026 API access\",\"aiP1\":\"AI agents, bots, and automated systems may use the Platform through our API and MCP server integrations. If you operate an AI agent that interacts with the Platform, you are fully responsible for all actions taken by your agent, including bounty creation, communication with Workers, payment obligations, and compliance with these Terms.\",\"aiP2\":\"You agree that: (a) your AI agent will comply with all applicable rate limits and usage quotas for your subscription tier; (b) you will not use AI agents to spam, harass, or defraud other users; (c) you will not attempt to circumvent Platform security measures, content moderation, or access controls; (d) you are liable for any financial obligations incurred by your AI agent on the Platform; and (e) bounties created by your AI agent are binding commitments.\",\"prohibitedTitle\":\"11. prohibited conduct\",\"prohibitedIntro\":\"You agree not to:\",\"prohibitedItem1\":\"Post illegal, harmful, threatening, abusive, harassing, defamatory, or sexually explicit content\",\"prohibitedItem2\":\"Create fraudulent bounties, fake profiles, or misleading task descriptions\",\"prohibitedItem3\":\"Engage in scams, phishing, or social engineering against other users\",\"prohibitedItem4\":\"Solicit off-platform payments to circumvent the Platform's payment systems\",\"prohibitedItem5\":\"Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or scrape the Platform\",\"prohibitedItem6\":\"Circumvent or attempt to circumvent rate limits, security measures, or access controls\",\"prohibitedItem7\":\"Create multiple accounts for the purpose of evading bans or restrictions\",\"prohibitedItem8\":\"Impersonate RentAHuman staff, moderators, or other users\",\"prohibitedItem9\":\"Use the Platform for any activity that violates applicable local, state, national, or international law\",\"prohibitedItem10\":\"Post bounties for tasks that are illegal, dangerous, or violate the rights of others\",\"prohibitedItem11\":\"Harvest or collect personal information of other users without consent\",\"prohibitedItem12\":\"Interfere with or disrupt the Platform, servers, or connected networks\",\"prohibitedItem13\":\"Use automated systems to access the Platform in a manner that exceeds reasonable request volume\",\"prohibitedClosing\":\"Violations may result in content removal, account suspension, permanent bans, and/or referral to law enforcement authorities.\",\"disputesTitle\":\"12. disputes between users\",\"disputesP1\":\"RentAHuman provides a dispute resolution mechanism for transactions conducted through our escrow system. For escrow-based disputes, our administrators may review evidence submitted by both parties and make a determination regarding fund distribution. However, you acknowledge that:\",\"disputesItem1\":\"RentAHuman's dispute resolution is provided as a service and is not a substitute for legal proceedings\",\"disputesItem2\":\"Our administrators' decisions in disputes are final within the Platform context\",\"disputesItem3\":\"We are not obligated to intervene in disputes between users, particularly for transactions conducted outside the escrow system\",\"disputesItem4\":\"For cryptocurrency payments made directly between users, RentAHuman has no ability to reverse, modify, or adjudicate transactions\",\"disputesP2\":\"You agree to release RentAHuman from any claims, demands, and damages arising from disputes between you and other Platform users.\",\"verificationTitle\":\"13. verification \u0026 subscriptions\",\"verificationP1\":\"The Platform offers paid verification subscriptions that provide benefits such as verified badges, enhanced visibility, and access to premium features. Verification indicates that a user has completed our payment-based identity check; it does not constitute an endorsement, background check, or guarantee of trustworthiness by RentAHuman.\",\"verificationP2\":\"Subscription fees are charged on a recurring basis through Stripe. You may cancel your subscription at any time through your account or Stripe customer portal. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. No partial or prorated refunds will be issued for unused subscription time.\",\"ipTitle\":\"14. intellectual property\",\"ipP1\":\"The Platform, including its design, code, logos, trademarks, and all original content, is the property of RentAHuman and is protected by intellectual property laws. You may not copy, reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from the Platform without our express written consent.\",\"ipP2\":\"The RentAHuman name, logo, and all related names, logos, product and service names, designs, and slogans are trademarks of RentAHuman. You may not use such marks without our prior written permission.\",\"liabilityTitle\":\"15. limitation of liability\",\"liabilityP1\":\"TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, RENTAHUMAN, ITS OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, AGENTS, AND AFFILIATES SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, PUNITIVE, OR EXEMPLARY DAMAGES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO DAMAGES FOR LOSS OF PROFITS, GOODWILL, DATA, OR OTHER INTANGIBLE LOSSES, ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH:\",\"liabilityItem1\":\"Your use of or inability to use the Platform\",\"liabilityItem2\":\"Any User Content, including scam bounties, fraudulent profiles, or misleading task descriptions\",\"liabilityItem3\":\"Any conduct or content of any third party on the Platform\",\"liabilityItem4\":\"Unauthorized access to, use of, or alteration of your account or data\",\"liabilityItem5\":\"Transactions between users, whether through escrow, cryptocurrency, or other payment methods\",\"liabilityItem6\":\"Physical harm, personal injury, or property damage resulting from tasks performed through the Platform\",\"liabilityItem7\":\"Any third-party websites, services, or resources linked from the Platform\",\"liabilityItem8\":\"Failures or errors in payment processing by Stripe or other payment providers\",\"liabilityItem9\":\"Loss of cryptocurrency due to wallet errors, network issues, or incorrect addresses\",\"liabilityItem10\":\"AI agent actions, including automated bounty creation or messaging\",\"liabilityP2\":\"IN NO EVENT SHALL RENTAHUMAN'S TOTAL LIABILITY TO YOU FOR ALL CLAIMS ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING TO THESE TERMS OR THE USE OF THE PLATFORM EXCEED THE AMOUNT YOU HAVE PAID TO RENTAHUMAN IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM, OR ONE HUNDRED DOLLARS ($100), WHICHEVER IS LESS.\",\"warrantyTitle\":\"16. disclaimer of warranties\",\"warrantyP1\":\"THE PLATFORM AND ALL SERVICES ARE PROVIDED ON AN \\\"AS IS\\\" AND \\\"AS AVAILABLE\\\" BASIS WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. RENTAHUMAN DOES NOT WARRANT THAT THE PLATFORM WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, SECURE, OR ERROR-FREE, THAT ANY DEFECTS WILL BE CORRECTED, OR THAT THE PLATFORM IS FREE OF VIRUSES OR OTHER HARMFUL COMPONENTS.\",\"warrantyP2\":\"We make no warranties or representations about the accuracy, reliability, completeness, or timeliness of any User Content, bounty postings, user profiles, reviews, ratings, or any other information made available on or through the Platform.\",\"indemnityTitle\":\"17. indemnification\",\"indemnityP1\":\"You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless RentAHuman, its officers, directors, employees, agents, and affiliates from and against any and all claims, damages, obligations, losses, liabilities, costs, and expenses (including attorney's fees) arising from: (a) your use of the Platform; (b) your violation of these Terms; (c) your User Content; (d) your violation of any rights of another person or entity; (e) any dispute between you and another user; (f) any task, bounty, or transaction you participate in through the Platform; and (g) any actions taken by AI agents operating under your account or API keys.\",\"privacyTitle\":\"18. privacy \u0026 data\",\"privacyP1\":\"Your use of the Platform is also governed by our data practices. We collect and process personal information including account details, profile information, transaction data, usage analytics, and communication records to operate the Platform. By using the Platform, you consent to the collection, use, and processing of your information as described herein.\",\"privacyP2\":\"We use third-party services including Firebase (authentication and database), Stripe (payments), PostHog (analytics), and Cloudflare (security) which may collect and process data according to their respective privacy policies.\",\"terminationTitle\":\"19. termination\",\"terminationP1\":\"We may suspend or terminate your account and access to the Platform at any time, with or without cause, and with or without notice. Reasons for termination include but are not limited to: violation of these Terms, fraudulent activity, chargebacks, abusive behavior, creating scam bounties, or any activity we deem harmful to the Platform or its users.\",\"terminationP2\":\"Upon termination: (a) your right to use the Platform ceases immediately; (b) your API keys will be revoked; (c) you remain liable for all obligations incurred prior to termination; (d) no refunds will be issued for any prepaid fees; and (e) Sections 5, 6, 7, 8, 11, 13, 14, 15, 16, and 19 shall survive termination.\",\"governingTitle\":\"20. governing law \u0026 dispute resolution\",\"governingP1\":\"These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any disputes arising out of or relating to these Terms or the Platform shall be resolved through binding arbitration in accordance with the rules of the American Arbitration Association. You agree to waive any right to a jury trial or to participate in a class action lawsuit against RentAHuman.\",\"generalTitle\":\"21. general provisions\",\"severabilityBold\":\"Severability:\",\"severabilityText\":\"If any provision of these Terms is found to be unenforceable or invalid, that provision shall be limited or eliminated to the minimum extent necessary so that these Terms shall otherwise remain in full force and effect.\",\"entireBold\":\"Entire Agreement:\",\"entireText\":\"These Terms, together with any additional terms you agree to when using particular elements of the Platform, constitute the entire agreement between you and RentAHuman regarding your use of the Platform.\",\"waiverBold\":\"Waiver:\",\"waiverText\":\"The failure of RentAHuman to enforce any right or provision of these Terms will not constitute a waiver of future enforcement of that right or provision.\",\"assignmentBold\":\"Assignment:\",\"assignmentText\":\"You may not assign or transfer these Terms or your rights hereunder without our prior written consent. We may assign these Terms without restriction.\",\"contactTitle\":\"22. contact\",\"contactText\":\"If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us through the Platform's feedback system on your\",\"contactAccount\":\"account\",\"contactOr\":\"or reach out on our\",\"contactDiscord\":\"Discord server\",\"acknowledgment\":\"by using rentahuman, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these terms of service. if you do not agree, you must discontinue use of the platform immediately.\"},\"authErrors\":{\"googleDevUnavailable\":\"google sign-in is unavailable in local development. use email + password, or test on a deployed preview url.\",\"googleSecureBrowserRequired\":\"google sign-in is blocked inside this app browser. open rentahuman.ai in Safari, Chrome, or your default browser, then try again.\",\"googleAccountExistsPassword\":\"an account already exists for this email. sign in with email + password, or reset your password if you do not know it.\",\"googleSignupRequired\":\"this Google account is new. complete human verification and accept the terms to create your account.\",\"openInBrowser\":\"open in browser\",\"copyLink\":\"copy link\",\"linkCopied\":\"link copied\",\"turnstileRequired\":\"complete human verification before signing up.\",\"unknown\":\"something went wrong. please try again.\"},\"adminPartners\":{\"exactSource\":\"Exact source\",\"externalChatId\":\"External chat ID\",\"requesterPhoneNumber\":\"Requester phone number\",\"sourceMissing\":\"This legacy request has missing or invalid exact source provenance.\",\"sourceRequiredForBounty\":\"Save the exact chat ID and requester phone number before creating a bounty.\",\"saveExactSource\":\"Save exact source\",\"savingExactSource\":\"Saving exact source…\",\"createBounty\":\"Create bounty ↗\",\"checkoutPayments\":\"Checkout payments\",\"linkedBountiesAndEscrow\":\"Linked bounties / escrow\",\"noLinkedBounties\":\"No linked bounties\",\"bounty\":\"bounty\",\"primary\":\"primary\",\"missingBountyDocument\":\"missing bounty document\",\"escrow\":\"escrow\",\"escrowNone\":\"escrow: none\",\"status\":\"status\",\"fundedAt\":\"funded at\",\"paidAt\":\"paid at\",\"paid\":\"paid\",\"pending\":\"pending\",\"expired\":\"expired\",\"unknown\":\"unknown\",\"courier\":{\"coordination\":\"Coordination\",\"coordinationDescription\":\"Coordinate people and courier legs for this request.\",\"people\":\"People\",\"courierRuns\":\"Courier runs\",\"addCourierRun\":\"Add courier run\",\"noCourierRuns\":\"No courier runs yet\",\"sandboxBadge\":\"SANDBOX — no real courier\",\"productionBadge\":\"PRODUCTION — real courier and charges\",\"sandboxDescription\":\"Courier providers are enabled only when their test configuration is available.\",\"sandboxNotice\":\"Sandbox only — no real couriers are dispatched.\",\"productionNotice\":\"Uber Direct production is enabled. Dispatching creates a real delivery and may incur charges.\",\"uberTestModeBadge\":\"TEST MODE — verify Uber credentials\",\"uberSafetyDescription\":\"Uber shares live API hosts. Continue only after confirming Dashboard Test-mode credentials.\",\"uberProductionSafetyDescription\":\"Uber Direct production uses real couriers and billable services. Continue only after confirming the production credentials and delivery details.\",\"luggSafetyDescription\":\"Lugg uses its fixed sandbox host. No real courier will arrive.\",\"provider\":\"Provider\",\"providers\":{\"uberDirect\":\"Uber Direct\",\"lugg\":\"Lugg\"},\"providerMissingConfiguration\":\"Credentials are not configured for this environment.\",\"providerDisabled\":\"This provider is disabled until its configuration is corrected.\",\"noProvidersAvailable\":\"No courier provider is available. Configure credentials first.\",\"pickup\":\"Pickup\",\"dropoff\":\"Drop-off\",\"address\":\"Address\",\"contactName\":\"Contact name\",\"phoneNumber\":\"Phone number\",\"instructions\":\"Instructions\",\"handoffNotes\":\"Handoff notes\",\"items\":\"Items\",\"itemDescription\":\"Item description\",\"quantity\":\"Quantity\",\"size\":\"Size\",\"sizes\":{\"small\":\"Small\",\"medium\":\"Medium\",\"large\":\"Large\",\"xlarge\":\"Extra large\"},\"luggProduct\":\"Lugg vehicle\",\"products\":{\"lite\":\"Lite\",\"pickup\":\"Pickup\",\"van\":\"Van\",\"xl\":\"XL\",\"box\":\"Box truck\"},\"addItem\":\"Add item\",\"removeItem\":\"Remove item\",\"relatedPeople\":\"Related people\",\"noRelatedPeople\":\"No linked people are available for this request.\",\"getQuote\":\"Get quote\",\"gettingQuote\":\"Getting quote…\",\"cancelForm\":\"Close form\",\"back\":\"Back\",\"quote\":\"Quote\",\"retryQuote\":\"Retry quote\",\"requote\":\"Get new quote\",\"quoting\":\"Getting new quote…\",\"quoteExpired\":\"This quote has expired. Get a new quote before dispatch.\",\"priceRange\":\"{low}–{high}\",\"estimatedMinutes\":\"About {minutes} min\",\"expiresAt\":\"Expires {time}\",\"arrivalWindow\":\"Arrival window\",\"chooseArrivalWindow\":\"Choose an arrival window\",\"chooseWindowHint\":\"Choose an arrival window to enable dispatch.\",\"providerStatus\":\"Provider status\",\"tracking\":\"Open tracking ↗\",\"lastError\":\"Provider detail\",\"statuses\":{\"draft\":\"Draft\",\"quoted\":\"Quoted\",\"dispatching\":\"Dispatching\",\"dispatchUnknown\":\"Dispatch needs reconciliation\",\"dispatched\":\"Dispatched\",\"inProgress\":\"In progress\",\"cancelling\":\"Cancelling\",\"cancelUnknown\":\"Cancellation needs refresh\",\"completed\":\"Completed\",\"failed\":\"Failed\",\"cancelled\":\"Cancelled\"},\"dispatch\":\"Dispatch test run\",\"dispatching\":\"Dispatching…\",\"uberDispatchConsequence\":\"This sends a Robo Courier request with the configured Uber credentials. Continue only if the Direct Dashboard is in Test mode.\",\"uberProductionDispatchConsequence\":\"This dispatches a real courier through Uber Direct and may incur charges.\",\"luggDispatchConsequence\":\"This creates a booking on Lugg’s sandbox host. No real courier will arrive.\",\"confirmDispatch\":\"Dispatch test run\",\"confirmProductionDispatch\":\"Dispatch real courier\",\"reconcile\":\"Reconcile dispatch\",\"reconciling\":\"Reconciling…\",\"refresh\":\"Refresh provider status\",\"refreshing\":\"Refreshing…\",\"cancelRun\":\"Cance